73
00:11:07,480 --> 00:11:07,860
Come on.

74
00:11:08,800 --> 00:11:10,260
Obviously, I'm gonna commit crimes.

75
00:11:12,820 --> 00:11:16,600
But I'm not gonna go out of my way to, you know, drive over old women.

76
00:11:17,440 --> 00:11:19,520
Stuff like that, I'm not really interested in anyway.

77
00:11:20,140 --> 00:11:21,120
Unless it's really fun.

78
00:11:21,240 --> 00:11:27,040
If it's really fun to, you know, drive over old women, then I'm gonna do it.

79
00:11:29,610 --> 00:11:30,890
I'll do whatever is fun, right?

80
00:11:34,530 --> 00:11:36,070
You don't like GTA V much?

81
00:11:36,550 --> 00:11:37,910
You're optimistic about the new one.

82
00:11:38,270 --> 00:11:43,190
My suspicion is that it's gonna be more... or what's the word?

83
00:11:43,290 --> 00:11:45,150
It's gonna be less silly this time around.

84
00:11:46,090 --> 00:11:51,010
I mean, Grand Theft Auto is known to be silly, but I get the feeling that this one is maybe different, you know?

85
00:11:52,630 --> 00:11:55,590
Because how can they make satire out of the current world?

86
00:11:56,630 --> 00:11:58,170
The world is already satire.

87
00:11:58,270 --> 00:11:59,650
You can't make fun of that.

88
00:11:59,950 --> 00:12:02,810
The only way to go forward is to make something more serious.

89
00:12:07,100 --> 00:12:08,720
It's crazy, the times we live in.

90
00:12:14,640 --> 00:12:15,660
What did you have for lunch?

91
00:12:15,740 --> 00:12:17,140
I had smurple.

92
00:12:18,080 --> 00:12:20,800
I had rye bread with some sausage.

93
00:12:21,320 --> 00:12:22,580
Or salami, I guess.

94
00:12:24,100 --> 00:12:25,860
Potato salami, apparently, it's called.

95
00:12:26,040 --> 00:12:27,500
And I had some raw onion on top.

96
00:12:29,260 --> 00:12:30,480
So I'm onioned up now.

97
00:12:36,110 --> 00:12:38,030
Satire is easy when the world is a joke.

98
00:12:39,190 --> 00:12:41,370
Yeah, but it's not gonna be that fun though, right?

99
00:12:42,770 --> 00:12:46,890
It's more fun to make fun of things that are serious in a fun way.

100
00:12:48,530 --> 00:12:49,310
I guess.

101
00:12:49,790 --> 00:12:50,730
But I know what you mean.

102
00:12:52,710 --> 00:12:53,390
Food quiz.

103
00:12:53,510 --> 00:12:54,670
Is it fake or Danish?

104
00:12:55,690 --> 00:12:56,290
It's Danish.

105
00:13:00,300 --> 00:13:01,560
Making me hungry for lunch.

106
00:13:01,760 --> 00:13:01,980
Really?

107
00:13:02,180 --> 00:13:04,880
The description I just gave of my lunch made you hungry.

108
00:13:05,960 --> 00:13:08,260
I mean... I guess so.

109
00:13:08,400 --> 00:13:12,100
I mean... If you like onion and salami... You know?

110
00:13:12,420 --> 00:13:13,300
It's a good combo.

111
00:13:15,360 --> 00:13:18,960
It's just not something I would consider, like... Really delicious food.

112
00:13:19,140 --> 00:13:20,760
It's like, okay, this is what I have in my fridge.

113
00:13:20,940 --> 00:13:21,560
I'll eat it.

114
00:13:22,980 --> 00:13:24,100
I'm hungry all the time.

115
00:13:24,100 --> 00:13:25,040
I feel you, man.

116
00:13:26,390 --> 00:13:29,010
I wish I could just keep eating without getting fat.

117
00:13:29,150 --> 00:13:30,170
That would be the life.

118
00:13:32,930 --> 00:13:33,630
It would.

119
00:13:34,830 --> 00:13:35,890
Let's play some Minecraft.

120
00:13:40,370 --> 00:13:40,930
Wait.

121
00:13:41,570 --> 00:13:42,990
That is the music from Minecraft.

122
00:13:43,190 --> 00:13:43,930
I was about to turn it down.

123
00:13:45,530 --> 00:13:46,790
