124
00:13:49,270 --> 00:13:50,130
Let's do this.

125
00:13:52,070 --> 00:13:54,790
Now, today is all about mining at first.

126
00:13:55,430 --> 00:14:01,310
Because if you remember... Actually... Do I remember?

127
00:14:01,810 --> 00:14:03,270
There's something I needed to remember.

128
00:14:06,420 --> 00:14:07,340
Oh yeah, I was doing this.

129
00:14:07,500 --> 00:14:11,060
And I rage quit a little bit at the end there because I couldn't figure out how to do this.

130
00:14:11,900 --> 00:14:13,120
So I'm just going to put it off for now.

131
00:14:13,740 --> 00:14:14,420
It's a problem.

132
00:14:14,440 --> 00:14:15,260
I'm just going to leave it.

133
00:14:15,580 --> 00:14:17,460
Come back to it later because now I'm going to go mining.

134
00:14:17,920 --> 00:14:19,900
I need iron.

135
00:14:20,920 --> 00:14:22,140
God, I'm getting good at saying that.

136
00:14:23,480 --> 00:14:27,760
This cardboard package, I really want to put it in there, you know?

137
00:14:28,360 --> 00:14:29,280
I'm going to put it in there.

138
00:14:32,430 --> 00:14:33,390
Yep, cool.

139
00:14:33,890 --> 00:14:34,510
Oh, there's another one.

140
00:14:36,390 --> 00:14:36,790
Um...

141
00:14:38,620 --> 00:14:39,720
Maybe while it's gone.

142
00:14:42,540 --> 00:14:44,020
Ah, there we go.

143
00:14:44,220 --> 00:14:44,640
There we go.

144
00:14:45,580 --> 00:14:45,960
Sweet.

145
00:14:48,100 --> 00:14:51,540
The factory... like, this is the new discovery, man.

146
00:14:51,980 --> 00:14:55,040
This whole thing... is life-changing.

147
00:14:55,840 --> 00:14:58,460
But we need more iron to make any of this happen.

148
00:14:58,620 --> 00:14:59,100
Iron.

149
00:14:59,540 --> 00:15:00,060
Iron.

150
00:15:00,360 --> 00:15:00,620
Iron.

151
00:15:00,980 --> 00:15:01,500
Iron.

152
00:15:05,190 --> 00:15:06,070
Put it all in there.

153
00:15:07,630 --> 00:15:08,990
Wait, should I bring my thingy?

154
00:15:09,970 --> 00:15:11,570
This could be sick while mining, right?

155
00:15:12,330 --> 00:15:13,350
I'm actually gonna bring it.

156
00:15:15,030 --> 00:15:16,150
I think it could be nice.

157
00:15:16,890 --> 00:15:17,850
Let's keep that here.

158
00:15:20,610 --> 00:15:21,890
Put all that crap in there.

159
00:15:28,030 --> 00:15:32,150
Put this stuff up here instead.

160
00:15:35,400 --> 00:15:36,220
Belt in there.

161
00:15:36,660 --> 00:15:37,100
Torch.

162
00:15:38,480 --> 00:15:38,920
Okay.

163
00:15:39,640 --> 00:15:42,360
Now, did I leave anything behind that I needed for my mining session?

164
00:15:44,340 --> 00:15:45,260
I don't think so.

165
00:15:46,780 --> 00:15:48,120
Torches are good, I guess.

166
00:15:53,460 --> 00:15:54,820
Where's my, uh...

167
00:15:57,860 --> 00:15:58,780
Oh, is it down here?

168
00:15:59,860 --> 00:16:00,540
Oh, there it is.

169
00:16:01,160 --> 00:16:01,880
This is what I need.

170
00:16:03,820 --> 00:16:04,460
Come with me.

171
00:16:09,480 --> 00:16:10,460
This is useless now.

172
00:16:12,220 --> 00:16:13,220
I'll take that with me.

173
00:16:13,360 --> 00:16:14,180
This guy's gonna stay here.

174
00:16:14,260 --> 00:16:14,940
Yeah, go to sleep.

175
00:16:21,930 --> 00:16:23,390
By the way, why did I need iron?

176
00:16:25,810 --> 00:16:26,630
There was a reason.

177
00:16:28,430 --> 00:16:32,290
I needed iron because... Because why?

178
00:16:33,290 --> 00:16:35,650
Maybe because I needed it to make more vaults or something?

179
00:16:37,470 --> 00:16:38,890
In any case, we need it.

180
00:16:39,190 --> 00:16:39,930
It's important.

181
00:16:41,990 --> 00:16:42,430
Jimmy?

182
00:16:43,270 --> 00:16:44,390
Jimmy Thee, I mean.

183
00:16:45,610 --> 00:16:46,450
Are we good here?

184
00:16:47,130 --> 00:16:48,770
We got this, we got that.

185
00:16:50,810 --> 00:16:51,910
Definitely need my bow.

186
00:16:55,030 --> 00:16:56,390
If I can remember where I put it.

187
00:16:57,050 --> 00:16:58,550
Now this we don't need right now.

188
00:17:02,690 --> 00:17:03,550
I'll put it here.

189
00:17:10,770 --> 00:17:12,190
I think it must all be at home.

190
00:17:13,050 --> 00:17:13,830
Meaning in here.

191
00:17:17,780 --> 00:17:18,800
No?

192
00:17:19,520 --> 00:17:20,560
Downstairs, maybe.

193
00:17:26,910 --> 00:17:28,230
Ah, there it is.

194
00:17:30,710 --> 00:17:31,470
Very good.

195
00:17:32,510 --> 00:17:33,430
Just one arrow.

196
00:17:34,970 --> 00:17:36,710
And that's pretty much it.

197
00:17:36,910 --> 00:17:40,570
Now, I am tempted to bring the disassembly thingy.

198
00:17:42,270 --> 00:17:43,010
Should I?

199
00:17:43,970 --> 00:17:46,910
Or do I trust in my ability to not fuck it up?

200
00:17:47,710 --> 00:17:49,730
I trust in my ability to not fuck it up.

201
00:17:50,150 --> 00:17:50,710
Actually.

202
00:17:51,090 --> 00:17:52,850
I think I can do that.

203
00:17:54,690 --> 00:17:55,250
Yeah.

204
00:17:56,300 --> 00:17:58,220
Maybe some sticks to make a couple torches.

205
00:18:01,680 --> 00:18:02,580
Not all of them, though.

206
00:18:02,740 --> 00:18:03,340
We need some coal.

207
00:18:06,260 --> 00:18:06,820
That's good.

208
00:18:08,140 --> 00:18:09,180
Now, where do we go?

209
00:18:09,800 --> 00:18:10,600
Is the question.

210
00:18:13,640 --> 00:18:15,900
I just want to check if we have any blast powder left.

211
00:18:17,940 --> 00:18:19,000
Would love to fly.

212
00:18:25,510 --> 00:18:27,830
Powder... We got eleven!

213
00:18:28,170 --> 00:18:29,110
That's okay.

214
00:18:31,050 --> 00:18:34,630
Paper... Oh, wait.

215
00:18:37,450 --> 00:18:38,730
Eleven...

216
00:18:43,870 --> 00:18:44,310
33.

217
00:18:44,750 --> 00:18:45,110
Nice.

218
00:18:46,230 --> 00:18:47,070
Definitely flying.

219
00:18:49,490 --> 00:18:52,970
This is... we're gonna use... I guess when we're mining.

220
00:18:53,590 --> 00:18:54,670
And this is for flying.

221
00:18:55,730 --> 00:18:56,870
Now, I could bring a shield.

222
00:18:57,210 --> 00:18:59,610
But I feel like shields are for cowards.

223
00:19:00,510 --> 00:19:03,650
I have learned to play without a shield, so I'm never gonna need it again.

224
00:19:04,950 --> 00:19:06,370
I'm beyond that, right?

225
00:19:08,030 --> 00:19:10,130
Now, which way have I not gone yet?

226
00:19:12,140 --> 00:19:14,100
I feel like I haven't really explored that way.

227
00:19:14,300 --> 00:19:16,160
Which is actually the way I spawned.

228
00:19:16,920 --> 00:19:17,760
We're going that way.

229
00:19:19,260 --> 00:19:20,300
I'm gonna bring a compass.

230
00:19:21,620 --> 00:19:22,520
Actually very important.

231
00:19:24,240 --> 00:19:25,480
Compass so I can find my way home.

232
00:19:28,260 --> 00:19:29,780
And this one should point to my home.

233
00:19:32,140 --> 00:19:32,820
Let me see.

234
00:19:33,100 --> 00:19:34,900
It sure does, I believe.

235
00:19:38,760 --> 00:19:39,320
Yep.

236
00:19:39,600 --> 00:19:40,040
Nice.

237
00:19:41,060 --> 00:19:42,080
Off we go!

238
00:19:43,800 --> 00:19:44,680
Adventures await.

239
00:19:44,840 --> 00:19:45,900
We're gonna be mining so hard.

240
00:19:51,630 --> 00:19:52,790
Oh, I didn't mean to click.

241
00:19:52,930 --> 00:19:53,750
I accidentally clicked.

242
00:19:53,890 --> 00:19:55,330
My mouse is really, like, sensitive.

243
00:19:55,330 --> 00:20:00,750
I have this Logitech X2 pulse sensor, whatever.

244
00:20:01,550 --> 00:20:05,470
So there's actually no, like, mechanical activator in there.

245
00:20:05,470 --> 00:20:06,250
It's like a setting.

246
00:20:06,690 --> 00:20:08,550
And I think the setting is, like, set too low.

247
00:20:08,790 --> 00:20:10,590
So I accidentally click on it sometimes.

248
00:20:12,130 --> 00:20:13,130
It's a cool mouse, though.

249
00:20:14,670 --> 00:20:16,230
It's a very unique sensation.

250
00:20:25,240 --> 00:20:26,400
Hey, that looks kind of interesting.

251
00:20:28,320 --> 00:20:28,980
Or that.

252
00:20:29,460 --> 00:20:30,620
Oh, I feel so free!

253
00:20:31,520 --> 00:20:35,720
Knowing I can always find my way home, it doesn't matter where I go, I don't have to pay attention to anything.

254
00:20:36,300 --> 00:20:37,200
I just go.

255
00:20:38,800 --> 00:20:40,260
You know what, actually, guys?

256
00:20:40,860 --> 00:20:42,480
Let's try and find a hotel.

257
00:20:43,460 --> 00:20:46,440
This is going to be a hotel-finding expedition and iron mining.

258
00:20:47,100 --> 00:20:48,200
Both at the same time.

259
00:20:51,140 --> 00:20:54,380
In fact... Okay, that's the portal.

260
00:20:56,540 --> 00:20:58,160
I'm actually going to make a prediction for this.

261
00:20:59,920 --> 00:21:01,700
And this requires a timer, okay?

262
00:21:04,720 --> 00:21:05,660
Let me see here.

263
00:21:07,600 --> 00:21:08,760
I'm going to make a prediction.

264
00:21:09,540 --> 00:21:15,920
It's going to be... Will I find a hotel in 30 minutes?

265
00:21:16,320 --> 00:21:18,420
And I'm really going to try, okay?

266
00:21:20,070 --> 00:21:20,530
Yes.

267
00:21:20,530 --> 00:21:22,430
It's going to be... Yep.

268
00:21:23,550 --> 00:21:24,310
No way.

269
00:21:25,710 --> 00:21:27,430
You get two minutes to vote on that.

270
00:21:28,490 --> 00:21:29,150
Good luck.

271
00:21:32,470 --> 00:21:33,150
There you go.

272
00:21:33,850 --> 00:21:34,270
