Maybe... I guess we can keep that one high.

545
00:37:50,020 --> 00:37:51,300
Just want better performance here.

546
00:37:51,760 --> 00:37:55,240
I'm gonna be so far from home anyway, the simulation distance stuff is not gonna matter, right?

547
00:37:58,130 --> 00:37:59,050
I think that makes sense.

548
00:38:01,990 --> 00:38:03,850
Okay, so it looks like we got a big open ocean here.

549
00:38:03,910 --> 00:38:04,710
Oh, I didn't bring a boat.

550
00:38:05,450 --> 00:38:06,390
Let's quickly make one.

551
00:38:08,550 --> 00:38:09,950
Because I'm not going to fly the whole way.

552
00:38:10,530 --> 00:38:11,530
I am going to run out.

553
00:38:13,770 --> 00:38:14,790
Ah, disgusting trees.

554
00:38:14,890 --> 00:38:15,630
Why are they disgusting?

555
00:38:17,770 --> 00:38:18,910
I'm going to take this one over here.

556
00:38:38,360 --> 00:38:38,840
There we go.

557
00:38:40,380 --> 00:38:41,220
Taking that with me.

558
00:38:44,780 --> 00:38:46,180
I'm gonna conserve my ammo a little.

559
00:38:48,720 --> 00:38:49,420
Just for a bit.

560
00:38:50,080 --> 00:38:51,180
Now, let me see, where's the sun?

561
00:38:56,060 --> 00:38:57,140
Wait, actually, where's the sun?

562
00:38:57,200 --> 00:38:57,340
Oh.

563
00:39:00,600 --> 00:39:01,440
So that's west.

564
00:39:01,800 --> 00:39:02,460
What's this way?

565
00:39:02,540 --> 00:39:03,080
We gotta go this way.

566
00:39:04,280 --> 00:39:05,560
I'm trying to go southeast.

567
00:39:06,300 --> 00:39:08,760
Because I feel like that's a direction I haven't really explored.

568
00:39:15,820 --> 00:39:17,540
Oh no, we got iPhone people over there.

569
00:39:17,640 --> 00:39:18,100
I hate that.

570
00:39:21,760 --> 00:39:24,560
I'm gonna take a big detour around them.

571
00:39:33,780 --> 00:39:37,520
As soon as I find snow, I'm gonna start looking like crazy.

572
00:39:51,340 --> 00:39:52,960
We gotta take a route around that.

573
00:39:53,600 --> 00:39:54,840
I don't wanna risk anything.

574
00:39:55,560 --> 00:39:58,720
I feel like my game is lagging just as much with the simulation distance turned down.

575
00:40:00,540 --> 00:40:02,380
I wonder what is causing that, like, hiccup.

576
00:40:02,740 --> 00:40:06,400
Is it, like, loading of new areas, or... what is happening?

577
00:40:09,490 --> 00:40:09,930
No!

578
00:40:10,170 --> 00:40:10,770
Don't FaceTime me!

579
00:40:11,690 --> 00:40:12,650
Get away from me!

580
00:40:14,470 --> 00:40:16,050
I'm not interested in your calls.

581
00:40:18,490 --> 00:40:19,390
Village over there.

582
00:40:19,610 --> 00:40:20,670
Dude, what is with all this water?

583
00:40:21,790 --> 00:40:23,690
Have you ever seen this much water in Minecraft?

584
00:40:25,070 --> 00:40:26,650
The whole horizon is like water.

585
00:40:30,670 --> 00:40:32,690
Ooh, that's a funny looking... Look at that.

586
00:40:33,350 --> 00:40:35,370
Very methodical and systematic.

587
00:40:38,030 --> 00:40:38,690
Ice?

588
00:40:40,610 --> 00:40:41,270
Nope.

589
00:40:42,030 --> 00:40:42,930
Another Danish island?

590
00:40:43,730 --> 00:40:45,290
A tiny Danish island.

591
00:40:49,310 --> 00:40:50,430
Wait, that is ice!

592
00:40:52,070 --> 00:40:53,890
No, it's... desert.

593
00:40:56,230 --> 00:40:57,430
It looked white.

594
00:40:57,790 --> 00:40:58,890
So I was fooled.

595
00:41:06,530 --> 00:41:09,710
I feel like igloos are the most rare things to find in this game.

596
00:41:11,510 --> 00:41:12,850
Even more so than the hotel.

597
00:41:22,050 --> 00:41:23,210
Let me see what the timer's at.

598
00:41:25,010 --> 00:41:25,990
Ah, 15 minutes.

599
00:41:27,050 --> 00:41:27,850
Plenty of time.

600
00:41:28,990 --> 00:41:30,270
I will find it, trust me.

601
00:41:31,510 --> 00:41:33,670
When I put my mind to something, I will do it.

602
00:41:34,370 --> 00:41:34,930
You'll see.

603
00:41:42,820 --> 00:41:45,520
I am getting a little worried, though, that I'm not seeing land.

604
00:41:46,640 --> 00:41:49,280
I mean, land that isn't that way.

605
00:41:51,300 --> 00:41:52,000
And again?

606
00:41:52,840 --> 00:41:53,900
No, that's jungle.

607
00:41:55,460 --> 00:41:57,060
We don't need jungle, I'm afraid.

608
00:42:04,410 --> 00:42:05,430
You know what, actually?

609
00:42:06,270 --> 00:42:08,410
I really like the way this biome looks.

610
00:42:08,990 --> 00:42:15,390
Imagine having, like, an underwater city here with, like, lots of windows in this sort of biome.

611
00:42:15,510 --> 00:42:16,730
Wouldn't that be really cool?

612
00:42:17,530 --> 00:42:19,330
I think the visuals would be crazy.

613
00:42:21,670 --> 00:42:30,210
Basically making, like, a base, you know, with... Yeah, I guess we could make, like, a moon pool or something, you know?

614
00:42:31,050 --> 00:42:32,590
Connect them with...

615
00:42:33,840 --> 00:42:35,840
Tunnels and stuff, like, made of windows.

616
00:42:37,880 --> 00:42:40,240
Dude, look how big this biome is here.

617
00:42:42,600 --> 00:42:44,000
This would be the place to do it.

618
00:42:45,780 --> 00:42:46,860
Live among the fishes.

619
00:42:51,640 --> 00:42:53,420
Almost whole horizon is water now.

620
00:42:54,260 --> 00:42:55,860
Have you ever seen anything like this?

621
00:42:56,400 --> 00:42:57,420
I don't think you have.

622
00:43:01,040 --> 00:43:02,140
This is wild.

623
00:43:02,480 --> 00:43:03,420
And this just keeps going.

624
00:43:03,620 --> 00:43:04,180
Oh my goodness.

625
00:43:07,400 --> 00:43:08,020
Massive.

626
00:43:16,300 --> 00:43:17,780
Is the whole horizon water?

627
00:43:18,020 --> 00:43:19,800
The whole horizon is water.

628
00:43:22,160 --> 00:43:22,780
Damn.

629
00:43:26,100 --> 00:43:27,400
Let me go more like this way now.

630
00:43:28,260 --> 00:43:29,460
I'm going straight south.

631
00:43:31,300 --> 00:43:33,320
At some point, we're going to end up at the south pole, right?

632
00:43:34,800 --> 00:43:35,820
There's a portal down there.

633
00:43:37,780 --> 00:43:39,380
I am tempted to check it out.

634
00:43:40,960 --> 00:43:41,820
Just a quick peek.

635
00:43:42,000 --> 00:43:42,720
I'm not going to go inside.

636
00:43:42,840 --> 00:43:47,280
I'm just going to loot the chest, grab the gold, and keep going.

637
00:43:55,040 --> 00:43:56,040
Desert over there.

638
00:43:57,640 --> 00:43:58,860
Actually, it's a fake desert.

639
00:44:00,160 --> 00:44:01,080
It's a beach.

640
00:44:03,880 --> 00:44:08,340
Oh, it's a big portal!

641
00:44:12,800 --> 00:44:13,400
Useless.

642
00:44:18,220 --> 00:44:19,320
Look at me using the tech.

643
00:44:23,500 --> 00:44:24,500
Okay, boring.

644
00:44:26,120 --> 00:44:27,040
I'm on a timer here.

645
00:44:27,120 --> 00:44:28,180
I gotta go find an igloo.

646
00:44:30,280 --> 00:44:32,120
Wait, which way was... this way.

647
00:44:34,800 --> 00:44:35,920
Dude, maybe I'll start flying.

648
00:44:36,220 --> 00:44:36,640
Oh, here we go.

649
00:44:37,380 --> 00:44:38,160
More cows?

650
00:44:42,110 --> 00:44:43,130
I can't believe it.

651
00:44:44,190 --> 00:44:45,730
I don't want to FaceTime these people.

652
00:44:45,850 --> 00:44:46,450
Please don't.

653
00:44:47,790 --> 00:44:49,290
I'm gonna have to take a detour again.

654
00:44:59,170 --> 00:45:02,390
Wow, this has to be, like, the biggest ocean I've ever seen in this game.

655
00:45:09,160 --> 00:45:11,140
Whoa, wait, that's a massive island.

656
00:45:14,000 --> 00:45:14,940
There's like two of them.

657
00:45:21,760 --> 00:45:22,840
Three of them, maybe, even.

658
00:45:23,800 --> 00:45:24,700
Is that a smaller one there?

659
00:45:27,860 --> 00:45:29,360
No, I think it's one island there.

660
00:45:42,520 --> 00:45:45,560
Why does that sound have to be so aggressive and loud?

661
00:46:07,720 --> 00:46:08,360
Village.

662
00:46:10,420 --> 00:46:12,620
I regret going in this direction.

663
00:46:13,600 --> 00:46:14,780
There's nothing here.

664
00:46:15,680 --> 00:46:17,660
It's just water and weird islands.

665
00:46:19,380 --> 00:46:20,340
Another one!

666
00:46:22,620 --> 00:46:23,820
We've reached Denmark.

667
00:46:26,920 --> 00:46:28,160
That's what this is.

668
00:46:29,920 --> 00:46:30,560
Wow.

669
00:46:33,040 --> 00:46:34,700
Wait, that's a massive island too.

670
00:46:34,760 --> 00:46:35,580
Look at that, it keeps going.

671
00:46:43,280 --> 00:46:44,160
Okay, I've had it.

672
00:46:46,140 --> 00:46:46,500
Fly!

673
00:46:47,940 --> 00:46:48,980
I don't have time for this.

674
00:46:49,020 --> 00:46:49,800
I gotta find an igloo.

675
00:46:51,440 --> 00:46:52,500
Also, which way is south?

676
00:46:53,720 --> 00:46:56,440
I think, like, this way is south.

677
00:47:03,080 --> 00:47:04,260
Okay, look for ice.

678
00:47:14,100 --> 00:47:14,740
This way.

679
00:47:16,100 --> 00:47:17,080
I can smell it.

680
00:47:17,180 --> 00:47:17,560
It's this way.

681
00:47:28,460 --> 00:47:29,860
Got massive mountains here.

682
00:47:30,700 --> 00:47:31,780
Finally reached land.

683
00:47:32,020 --> 00:47:34,040
Right when I abandoned my boat as well.

684
00:47:35,640 --> 00:47:36,460
Classic, isn't it?

685
00:47:42,630 --> 00:47:44,370
Maybe I should have just journeyed through the nether.

686
00:47:45,390 --> 00:47:46,450
That would have been faster.

687
00:47:50,530 --> 00:47:51,410
There's no snow!

688
00:48:08,690 --> 00:48:09,370
Keep going.

689
00:48:19,240 --> 00:48:21,200
The ability is half on my elytra.

690
00:48:23,140 --> 00:48:24,320
Got to keep an eye on that.

691
00:48:26,320 --> 00:48:28,900
Honestly, I don't think we're going to lose it, even with five rockets left.

692
00:48:32,600 --> 00:48:33,380
Another village.

693
00:48:35,220 --> 00:48:36,540
I send snow nearby.

694
00:48:42,580 --> 00:48:43,440
Go this way now.

695
00:49:05,400 --> 00:49:07,500
I got a lot of mileage out of that one rocket there.

696
00:49:23,540 --> 00:49:24,560
Man, come on!

697
00:49:30,390 --> 00:49:32,610
Jungle, that's the opposite of what we need.

698
00:49:34,250 --> 00:49:35,470
How am I in the tropics?

699
00:49:44,990 --> 00:49:46,230
Oh wait, yeah, that is a jungle.

700
00:49:54,590 --> 00:49:55,510
Only three left.

701
00:50:05,890 --> 00:50:06,990
How much time do we have left?

702
00:50:07,090 --> 00:50:07,330
Let's see.

703
00:50:09,490 --> 00:50:10,230
Six minutes!

704
00:50:10,910 --> 00:50:12,390
Ooh, I gotta hurry.

705
00:50:14,290 --> 00:50:15,110
Come on, man.

706
00:50:17,010 --> 00:50:17,930
Where's the ice?

707
00:50:25,130 --> 00:50:27,330
I'm crossing another ocean in hopes of finding ice.

708
00:50:28,170 --> 00:50:29,170
It's a risky play.

709
00:50:29,290 --> 00:50:30,030
Let's see if it pays off.

710
00:50:33,020 --> 00:50:34,860
I could have been stuck out here without a boat.

711
00:50:35,600 --> 00:50:37,440
This was a risky, risky move.

712
00:50:38,100 --> 00:50:39,380
I need to make another boat.

713
00:50:40,660 --> 00:50:42,640
Yeah, this is the opposite of ice, man.

714
00:50:43,620 --> 00:50:44,480
Gosh, dang.

715
00:50:46,020 --> 00:50:46,900
Looks cool, though.

716
00:50:48,020 --> 00:50:48,640
Cool biome.

717
00:50:50,460 --> 00:50:51,500
Last rocket here.

718
00:50:53,780 --> 00:50:54,400
Come on!

719
00:50:59,750 --> 00:51:04,150
Dude, I'm in the driest region on planet Minecraft right now.

720
00:51:06,430 --> 00:51:07,370
But you know what?

721
00:51:08,130 --> 00:51:10,530
The night is always darkest just before dawn.

722
00:51:15,290 --> 00:51:16,650
I'm gonna make a boat here.

723
00:51:18,850 --> 00:51:20,230
And we're gonna sail on.

724
00:51:21,910 --> 00:51:23,350
I believe we can do it still.

725
00:51:33,820 --> 00:51:35,340
Show me the snow, Lebowski!

726
00:51:42,980 --> 00:51:46,300
There was something else I wanted to do on this trip, other than finding an igloo.

727
00:51:53,580 --> 00:51:56,880
Guys, without rockets, I have a bad feeling about this.

728
00:51:57,000 --> 00:51:57,300
Oh, shit.

729
00:52:01,080 --> 00:52:02,280
We're not gonna get far.

730
00:52:04,120 --> 00:52:06,060
At least I have stakes to sustain me.

731
00:52:15,600 --> 00:52:16,120
Run!

732
00:52:21,060 --> 00:52:21,840
Four minutes!

733
00:52:31,520 --> 00:52:34,040
Normally I would go on top of a mountain to have a better view around.

734
00:52:34,740 --> 00:52:35,980
But I don't have time for that now.

735
00:52:36,080 --> 00:52:37,500
I have to gamble on a certain direction.

736
00:52:38,620 --> 00:52:39,700
I'm saying that direction.

737
00:52:40,900 --> 00:52:42,180
Because I see jungle on the right.

738
00:52:50,040 --> 00:52:50,660
Maximum speed.

739
00:52:57,080 --> 00:52:58,020
Okay, that was a bad idea.

740
00:53:06,930 --> 00:53:07,630
Are we cooked?

741
00:53:14,870 --> 00:53:15,730
Ice, ice, ice.

742
00:53:26,850 --> 00:53:28,370
I can feel it in my bones, it's over here.

743
00:53:47,410 --> 00:53:52,690
Actually, isn't it, like, super unlucky for me not to find any snow in this entire trip?

744
00:53:53,350 --> 00:53:55,310
Except that one tiny patch in the beginning.

745
00:53:57,110 --> 00:53:58,430
This seems very unlikely.

746
00:53:58,710 --> 00:53:59,510
I've been unlucky.

747
00:54:05,390 --> 00:54:06,910
And I've been scanning a lot.

748
00:54:14,610 --> 00:54:18,270
But I guess we would have to make up for the luck finding the hotel that fast.

749
00:54:18,670 --> 00:54:19,770
That was kind of absurd.

750
00:54:22,550 --> 00:54:23,710
I'm making up for that now.

751
00:54:27,230 --> 00:54:29,150
Oh, it's just more dry areas.

752
00:54:40,460 --> 00:54:41,340
Two minutes.

753
00:54:42,080 --> 00:54:43,100
It's not happening.

754
00:54:47,980 --> 00:54:50,060
The doubters will have their day.

755
00:54:54,380 --> 00:54:57,020
Which is, of course, very, very sad.

756
00:54:58,080 --> 00:54:59,520
But such is life sometimes.

757
00:54:59,740 --> 00:55:00,460
We gotta be fair.

758
00:55:12,090 --> 00:55:15,370
I feel like my only shot is to keep driving this boat.

759
00:55:16,890 --> 00:55:18,070
And not go on land.

760
00:55:25,650 --> 00:55:26,630
That's actually crazy.

761
00:55:27,230 --> 00:55:30,370
How much do you want to bet as soon as this timer fucking runs out, I'm gonna find ice?

762
00:55:35,200 --> 00:55:36,120
It's gonna happen.

763
00:55:37,620 --> 00:55:38,560
Oh, ice!

764
00:55:38,800 --> 00:55:39,440
I see ice!

765
00:55:40,140 --> 00:55:40,700
Go, go, go!

766
00:55:40,920 --> 00:55:41,620
One minute left!

767
00:55:42,780 --> 00:55:43,620
Let's go, baby!

768
00:55:45,920 --> 00:55:46,940
Come on, come on, come on, come on!

769
00:55:47,540 --> 00:55:48,440
Let's find an igloo!

770
00:55:49,420 --> 00:55:49,860
Igloo!

771
00:55:53,760 --> 00:55:54,320
Let's go!

772
00:55:55,520 --> 00:55:57,580
I think this may be the wrong ice, though.

773
00:55:58,560 --> 00:55:59,360
I see ice.

774
00:55:59,500 --> 00:56:00,500
Oh, it's very far away.

775
00:56:00,600 --> 00:56:01,220
I'm not gonna make it.

776
00:56:04,150 --> 00:56:05,390
Oh, not like this.

777
00:56:06,790 --> 00:56:07,530
Come on.

778
00:56:09,690 --> 00:56:10,430
Come on.

779
00:56:11,650 --> 00:56:14,190
Imagine there's a bug and an igloo is spawning right here.

780
00:56:15,270 --> 00:56:16,730
Fuck, I gotta get up here.

781
00:56:17,730 --> 00:56:18,270
Leave the boat.

782
00:56:22,050 --> 00:56:23,390
I work hard for the believers.

783
00:56:27,290 --> 00:56:29,590
It's got to be right on the edge of the biome, then.

784
00:56:30,990 --> 00:56:31,810
Ten seconds.

785
00:56:33,890 --> 00:56:35,250
There's no hope, is there?

786
00:56:35,490 --> 00:56:36,870
Ah, it's not even close.

787
00:56:37,190 --> 00:56:38,250
Ah, shit.

788
00:56:39,630 --> 00:56:40,230
No.

789
00:56:41,990 --> 00:56:43,350
No, man.

790
00:56:43,910 --> 00:56:44,270
No.

791
00:56:45,930 --> 00:56:47,530
Ah, that's it.

792
00:56:47,690 --> 00:56:48,150
That's it.

793
00:56:48,530 --> 00:56:49,990
There was no igloo.

794
00:56:50,710 --> 00:56:51,030
Narp.

795
00:56:53,070 --> 00:56:53,950
That's crazy.

796
00:56:57,030 --> 00:56:59,410
Well, guys, I tried my best.

797
00:56:59,650 --> 00:57:01,470
How do you want to bet there's an igloo right up here?

798
00:57:02,150 --> 00:57:02,930
Watch this.

799
00:57:07,970 --> 00:57:08,670
Imagine, though.

800
00:57:13,770 --> 00:57:15,250
I forgot what they look like.

801
00:57:17,650 --> 00:57:18,390
Not that.

802
00:57:20,210 --> 00:57:21,610
Why won't you destroy?

803
00:57:31,770 --> 00:57:32,510
Wait, that's it?

804
00:57:32,630 --> 00:57:33,370
That's all the ice I'm getting?

805
00:57:37,390 --> 00:57:38,250
That was it, huh?

806
00:57:39,570 --> 00:57:41,190
Wow, they're being stingy with it.

807
00:57:43,330 --> 00:57:44,590
They're being real stingy.

808
00:57:47,370 --> 00:57:48,550
A little bit here.

809
00:57:58,760 --> 00:57:59,900
I don't think... no.

810
00:58:00,640 --> 00:58:01,480
There's nothing here.

811
00:58:03,080 --> 00:58:04,100
Well, that's a bummer.

812
00:58:05,340 --> 00:58:06,980
Maybe we just go mine for a bit, then.

813
00:58:12,640 --> 00:58:14,400
Find a nice cave, you know?

814
00:58:14,900 --> 00:58:15,760
Lick our wounds!

815
00:58:24,500 --> 00:58:25,480
It is what it is.

816
00:58:27,900 --> 00:58:29,540
And I left my boat behind, of course.

817
00:58:30,400 --> 00:58:31,340
That was not smart.

818
00:58:35,060 --> 00:58:37,860
Second boat I've abandoned on this trip.

819
00:58:40,880 --> 00:58:42,560
Okay, let's find some iron then.

820
00:58:42,960 --> 00:58:43,480
Oh, ice!

821
00:58:43,700 --> 00:58:44,860
Never mind, we do ice.

822
00:58:47,220 --> 00:58:48,640
But this is the wrong ice.

823
00:58:48,720 --> 00:58:50,340
This is like the ice in the water.

824
00:58:51,640 --> 00:58:53,060
It's not snow, it's ice.

825
00:58:54,380 --> 00:58:55,640
And what I need is snow.

826
00:58:56,680 --> 00:58:58,280
But maybe snow is next to ice.

827
00:59:00,540 --> 00:59:02,120
Maybe that's the way I should think about it.

828
00:59:08,370 --> 00:59:09,590
Also, where are my creepers at?

829
00:59:09,650 --> 00:59:10,030
I need them.

830
00:59:15,890 --> 00:59:17,170
Oh, the snow is there.

831
00:59:17,170 --> 00:59:18,030
We got the snow.

832
00:59:32,770 --> 00:59:34,170
Let's go find an igloo.

833
01:00:04,650 --> 01:00:07,590
Hey, the good news about this snow biome is that there's not a lot of trees.

834
01:00:09,690 --> 01:00:10,630
Okay, there's over there.

835
01:00:24,110 --> 01:00:25,970
Alright, let's head into the snowy forest.

836
01:00:32,190 --> 01:00:33,190
This is my only hope.

837
01:00:40,350 --> 01:00:41,350
It will tell me.

838
01:00:56,730 --> 01:01:00,210
Even with elytra, it's not actually easy trying to find an igloo in this environment.

839
01:01:01,950 --> 01:01:04,570
Because from above, you know, the trees are covering things.

840
01:01:09,080 --> 01:01:10,440
Look for a lot of ice.

841
01:01:22,300 --> 01:01:26,060
I mean... Should I?

842
01:01:29,100 --> 01:01:30,860
Would be kind of cool to go down there.

843
01:01:33,380 --> 01:01:34,640
Let me just have a quick look.

844
01:01:34,800 --> 01:01:35,720
Scan the region.

845
01:01:41,610 --> 01:01:45,630
Maybe get up on a higher ground.

846
01:02:05,610 --> 01:02:07,170
I'm not seeing anything.

847
01:02:22,320 --> 01:02:22,760
Yep.

848
01:02:23,360 --> 01:02:24,460
Let's just go down in the hole.

849
01:02:25,000 --> 01:02:26,080
This is where we're gonna dig.

850
01:02:28,300 --> 01:02:29,240
It's taking time.

851
01:02:36,500 --> 01:02:36,940
Ow.

852
01:02:40,520 --> 01:02:41,560
We got kits again.

853
01:02:59,450 --> 01:03:00,470
That's what I came for.

854
01:03:03,950 --> 01:03:07,490
Now, of course, we're gonna find a good spot and we're gonna deploy the digging machine.

855
01:03:08,630 --> 01:03:10,850
But it needs to be a really promising and good spot.

856
01:03:15,270 --> 01:03:16,570
It's already looking good, actually.

857
01:03:17,170 --> 01:03:18,010
Good amount of iron here.

858
01:03:18,850 --> 01:03:19,750
Iron biome, maybe.

859
01:03:22,690 --> 01:03:23,430
Wait, hold on.

860
01:03:26,210 --> 01:03:27,270
That's a lot of iron.

861
01:03:28,910 --> 01:03:31,030
Is that like a... Oh, hold on.

862
01:03:31,250 --> 01:03:33,310
We may have got... Oh, hold up.

863
01:03:34,050 --> 01:03:35,270
Are we gonna find tough here?

864
01:03:40,410 --> 01:03:42,370
Or did I just get really lucky?

865
01:03:50,610 --> 01:03:52,210
Maybe I just got really lucky.

866
01:03:59,840 --> 01:04:00,160
Alright.

867
01:04:00,160 --> 01:04:00,480
Cool.

868
01:04:03,600 --> 01:04:04,760
That was a good amount of iron, though.

869
01:04:05,360 --> 01:04:06,120
Already a stack.

870
01:04:07,820 --> 01:04:08,140
Sweet.

871
01:04:10,880 --> 01:04:12,480
Yo, this is like the iron place.

872
01:04:12,680 --> 01:04:13,000
What?

873
01:04:13,380 --> 01:04:14,440
Why is there so much iron here?

874
01:04:17,840 --> 01:04:18,640
Maybe that's what it is.

875
01:04:18,740 --> 01:04:21,020
You know, snow biome is iron biome.

876
01:04:25,120 --> 01:04:26,500
Because I'm still in the snow biome.

877
01:04:37,470 --> 01:04:38,630
Kind of weird tunnels.

878
01:04:39,690 --> 01:04:40,690
Would love a big cave.

879
01:04:44,730 --> 01:04:45,930
Oh my god, yes.

880
01:04:47,030 --> 01:04:48,130
Oh, that's sweet.

881
01:04:58,010 --> 01:05:02,490
You know, ideally, actually, I would be here with a silk touch pickaxe that is upgraded.

882
01:05:05,490 --> 01:05:13,810
Because when you crush the whole block with iron, you actually get experience on top of the iron that you would get normally.

883
01:05:15,590 --> 01:05:16,790
Oh, I missed this.

884
01:05:30,820 --> 01:05:31,700
Ooh!

885
01:05:33,340 --> 01:05:34,640
Ooh, hello!

886
01:05:45,690 --> 01:05:46,690
Are they above me?

887
01:05:47,130 --> 01:05:48,610
Is a creeper gonna fall on me?

888
01:05:50,470 --> 01:05:51,590
I'm really scared of that.

889
01:05:53,250 --> 01:05:54,550
I've had it happen before.

890
01:05:57,130 --> 01:05:57,610
Creeper!

891
01:05:58,590 --> 01:06:00,490
I really need your blast powder.

892
01:06:10,940 --> 01:06:13,240
Dude, this may actually be faster than the digging machine.

893
01:06:13,800 --> 01:06:15,820
When you have this much iron just hanging around.

894
01:06:24,180 --> 01:06:26,220
And it looks like we're gonna get... Oh, yes!

895
01:06:26,580 --> 01:06:27,980
Yes, yes, yes, yes, yes.

896
01:06:29,620 --> 01:06:30,020
Fantastic.

897
01:06:33,310 --> 01:06:34,390
Oh, you know what I'm gonna do?

898
01:06:34,650 --> 01:06:36,070
We're gonna make a little headquarter here.

899
01:06:36,610 --> 01:06:37,810
In case I die, right?

900
01:06:37,890 --> 01:06:38,770
Imagine I die here.

901
01:06:39,830 --> 01:06:40,930
That would be insane.

902
01:06:42,350 --> 01:06:46,170
So let's just... Now we have made sure that if we die, we respawn there.

903
01:06:47,390 --> 01:06:48,470
Actually a huge play.

904
01:06:51,350 --> 01:06:52,730
Oh, there's plenty of iron.

905
01:06:55,630 --> 01:06:56,590
Get me up there.

906
01:07:16,460 --> 01:07:18,400
I see... Oh, there's a lot over there too.

907
01:07:30,830 --> 01:07:34,150
Now remember, this is just to get things going in the factory, right?

908
01:07:34,570 --> 01:07:39,210
When the factory is up and running, the factory will produce iron.

909
01:07:40,770 --> 01:07:43,010
This is the big thing, you know?

910
01:07:50,310 --> 01:07:52,030
In fact, I see tough and I see iron.

911
01:07:52,150 --> 01:07:52,710
You know what that means.

912
01:07:53,490 --> 01:07:56,270
Could potentially mean we got a big deposit of it.

913
01:07:57,290 --> 01:07:59,610
Lurking right below us.

914
01:08:16,210 --> 01:08:17,430
Ooh, okay.

915
01:08:17,770 --> 01:08:19,010
They want me to go deeper.

916
01:08:21,910 --> 01:08:22,690
Should I?

917
01:08:28,170 --> 01:08:28,630
Hmm.

918
01:08:29,450 --> 01:08:31,290
I think I'll stay at this elevation.

919
01:08:32,410 --> 01:08:33,770
And start the digging machine.

920
01:08:35,090 --> 01:08:36,030
Just to see what happens.

921
01:08:36,110 --> 01:08:36,750
I'm gonna go that way.

922
01:08:41,720 --> 01:08:42,340
Here we go.

923
01:08:43,080 --> 01:08:44,040
Dig for me!

924
01:08:45,280 --> 01:08:46,260
We're back at it.

925
01:08:46,460 --> 01:08:47,460
Let's make some more sticks.

926
01:08:50,160 --> 01:08:50,560
Good.

927
01:08:51,140 --> 01:08:52,360
In fact, I need more coal.

928
01:08:52,520 --> 01:08:53,800
I may not find coal at this depth.

929
01:08:55,320 --> 01:08:56,960
Unfortunate, but it is what it is.

930
01:09:03,020 --> 01:09:04,020
Let's cover that water.

931
01:09:08,660 --> 01:09:09,260
Oh no.

932
01:09:21,590 --> 01:09:22,450
Sick place.

933
01:09:28,810 --> 01:09:29,290
Oh.

934
01:09:35,190 --> 01:09:36,150
Where art thou?

935
01:09:36,250 --> 01:09:36,710
Is it that one?

936
01:09:42,950 --> 01:09:44,970
Dude, this is actually... look how much it's digging.

937
01:09:45,490 --> 01:09:47,030
Damn, this machine is big.

938
01:09:47,770 --> 01:09:48,630
Ooh, diamonds.

939
01:09:51,530 --> 01:09:52,370
I'll take that.

940
01:09:56,020 --> 01:10:00,060
Oh, we also need iron to make more drilling machines.

941
01:10:00,920 --> 01:10:02,360
So I can make this even bigger.

942
01:10:02,620 --> 01:10:03,340
Oh, but wait!

943
01:10:04,280 --> 01:10:05,980
Didn't we discover a whole new way to dig?

944
01:10:06,400 --> 01:10:08,180
We have, like, the rotating thingies now.

945
01:10:08,920 --> 01:10:10,920
I should make that, and for that we need iron.

946
01:10:11,300 --> 01:10:12,480
In fact, we need iron for all of it.

947
01:10:15,980 --> 01:10:16,740
Just need iron.

948
01:10:16,880 --> 01:10:17,340
Let me see here.

949
01:10:21,780 --> 01:10:23,600
Man, there's so much crap in this.

950
01:10:27,000 --> 01:10:28,260
Ah, that's horrible.

951
01:10:33,300 --> 01:10:35,820
Let's fill this up with all the good stuff here.

952
01:10:40,680 --> 01:10:41,600
Empty inventory.

953
01:10:49,860 --> 01:10:50,860
I think that's good.

954
01:11:05,310 --> 01:11:06,250
Take a bunch of this dirt.

955
01:11:21,460 --> 01:11:24,260
I feel like I'm wasting my torches by putting them here.

956
01:11:24,700 --> 01:11:26,700
God, I need carrots, man!

957
01:11:27,620 --> 01:11:29,380
Why are carrots so rare in this game?

958
01:11:29,500 --> 01:11:30,980
Like, how do I even acquire carrots?

959
01:11:31,880 --> 01:11:33,980
It feels like such an impossible task.

960
01:11:35,760 --> 01:11:36,780
Like, what's up with that?

961
01:11:52,630 --> 01:11:53,850
Oh, I'm gonna grab that.

962
01:12:06,670 --> 01:12:07,250
Wait, what?

963
01:12:07,410 --> 01:12:07,890
Oh, no.

964
01:12:16,640 --> 01:12:17,640
We hit a snag.

965
01:12:18,220 --> 01:12:20,040
Oh, so there is a limitation to this.

966
01:12:20,760 --> 01:12:24,080
If you hit the gravel, it's gonna not work anymore.

967
01:12:26,760 --> 01:12:27,380
It's fine.

968
01:12:29,040 --> 01:12:31,320
I'll keep going on foot for a bit.

969
01:12:43,460 --> 01:12:44,440
Oh, coal!

970
01:12:44,740 --> 01:12:45,300
Huge.

971
01:12:54,960 --> 01:12:55,600
Yes!

972
01:12:55,880 --> 01:12:56,500
Destroy the lava!

973
01:12:57,800 --> 01:12:58,740
Or don't.

974
01:12:59,460 --> 01:12:59,900
Okay.

975
01:13:04,940 --> 01:13:06,440
Filled up with torches again.

976
01:13:11,570 --> 01:13:12,770
I don't know why I'm going this way.

977
01:13:12,870 --> 01:13:13,890
This is not good.

978
01:13:15,930 --> 01:13:16,330
Stop!

979
01:13:20,150 --> 01:13:21,290
Didn't like that one bit.

980
01:13:40,060 --> 01:13:40,960
I don't know what I'm doing.

981
01:13:41,400 --> 01:13:42,980
What am I doing?

982
01:13:45,620 --> 01:13:46,320
I'm just gonna go.

983
01:13:48,300 --> 01:13:49,620
This feels good to my bones.

984
01:13:54,000 --> 01:13:58,320
Guys, I'm gonna... Okay, I heard someone.

985
01:13:58,740 --> 01:13:59,460
I'm gonna make a prediction.

986
01:14:09,700 --> 01:14:10,320
One minute.

987
01:14:11,220 --> 01:14:12,080
DAY OR NIGHT!

988
01:14:12,420 --> 01:14:13,120
I'm going up.

989
01:14:14,660 --> 01:14:16,920
I'm gonna stay at this depth for a bit and then I'm gonna go up.

990
01:14:35,880 --> 01:14:37,040
Where is this gonna lead me?

991
01:14:43,840 --> 01:14:44,720
Ooh, look at that.

992
01:14:44,940 --> 01:14:45,660
We got the green stuff.

993
01:14:48,600 --> 01:14:51,540
Oh, I should have brought my breathing apparatus.

994
01:14:52,000 --> 01:14:53,540
I already have a back tank, right?

995
01:14:54,420 --> 01:14:56,000
This would have been the perfect opportunity.

996
01:15:00,640 --> 01:15:03,940
Oh, but actually, if I do that, I would love to... I've been here.

997
01:15:04,360 --> 01:15:07,000
I would have loved to have night vision, right?

998
01:15:07,220 --> 01:15:08,260
And I don't have that still.

999
01:15:08,380 --> 01:15:09,120
Because we need carrots!

1000
01:15:09,960 --> 01:15:11,060
Freaking carrots, bro.

1001
01:15:26,210 --> 01:15:26,570
No!

1002
01:15:26,930 --> 01:15:27,870
Okay, I'm not gonna grab that.

1003
01:15:28,030 --> 01:15:28,570
Actually, I am.

1004
01:15:29,770 --> 01:15:30,550
Oh, that's my bed!

1005
01:15:36,810 --> 01:15:38,030
Let's go pick it up.

1006
01:15:39,630 --> 01:15:40,450
And get out of here.

1007
01:15:42,210 --> 01:15:44,090
By the way, I predict that it's gonna be day.

1008
01:15:45,170 --> 01:15:48,110
Because I have a positive outlook on things right now.

1009
01:15:49,630 --> 01:15:50,470
Night is negative.

1010
01:15:52,230 --> 01:15:53,750
Day is docetive, you know?

1011
01:16:01,350 --> 01:16:02,550
Don't you water me!

1012
01:16:09,550 --> 01:16:10,570
I got the bed.

1013
01:16:12,130 --> 01:16:13,090
Let's get out of here.

1014
01:16:16,470 --> 01:16:19,570
I'm making a staircase.

1015
01:16:49,520 --> 01:16:50,720
I'm excited!

1016
01:16:52,780 --> 01:16:54,320
What's it gonna be?

1017
01:17:04,420 --> 01:17:06,020
Oh, it's night.

1018
01:17:07,660 --> 01:17:08,980
It is indeed night.

1019
01:17:14,420 --> 01:17:15,140
Damn it.

1020
01:17:17,060 --> 01:17:19,180
If I could have bet, I would have bet on day.

1021
01:17:20,560 --> 01:17:21,520
That makes you feel better.

1022
01:17:26,680 --> 01:17:32,000
Okay, now... Oh, I do need your bones.

1023
01:17:36,500 --> 01:17:36,900
Ha!

1024
01:17:37,040 --> 01:17:37,660
Get chased, nerd!

1025
01:17:38,960 --> 01:17:39,720
Oh, wait a minute!

1026
01:17:39,800 --> 01:17:40,300
I have bones!

1027
01:17:42,260 --> 01:17:43,480
Oh no, I had bones!

1028
01:17:43,700 --> 01:17:44,520
I don't anymore.

1029
01:17:44,780 --> 01:17:45,100
Shit.

1030
01:17:47,940 --> 01:17:48,340
Man.

1031
01:17:48,660 --> 01:17:49,700
Why did I throw those away?

1032
01:17:49,880 --> 01:17:51,620
I actually had the thought earlier as well.

1033
01:17:53,720 --> 01:17:54,420
Okay, guys.

1034
01:17:54,700 --> 01:17:55,240
Here we go.

1035
01:17:55,440 --> 01:17:56,940
We're going for the igloo again, okay?

1036
01:17:58,680 --> 01:17:59,080
Igloo?

1037
01:18:02,330 --> 01:18:03,330
In 20 minutes?

1038
01:18:05,610 --> 01:18:06,110
Yep.

1039
01:18:07,130 --> 01:18:07,870
No way.

1040
01:18:10,130 --> 01:18:10,810
Good luck.

1041
01:18:12,590 --> 01:18:16,130
If I find an igloo before the minute runs out, nothing counts, of course.

1042
01:18:17,670 --> 01:18:18,910
But I'm gonna keep looking.

1043
01:18:19,470 --> 01:18:22,110
And remember, I'm starting in a snowy region now.

1044
01:18:22,790 --> 01:18:24,850
This is the gambling stream, man.

1045
01:18:28,080 --> 01:18:30,060
Why am I having so much fun with the gambling here?

1046
01:18:30,520 --> 01:18:31,700
I'm not even participating.

1047
01:18:32,600 --> 01:18:34,860
I'm just influencing the prediction markets.

1048
01:18:36,180 --> 01:18:37,160
That's kind of fun, you know?

1049
01:18:45,720 --> 01:18:47,280
By the way, I am gonna find an igloo.

1050
01:18:47,380 --> 01:18:48,480
I'm in a snowy region, come on.

1051
01:18:48,920 --> 01:18:49,960
I'm gonna find it.

1052
01:18:51,440 --> 01:18:53,240
If you say no to this, you're crazy.

1053
01:19:00,150 --> 01:19:00,430
Ah!

1054
01:19:00,770 --> 01:19:01,530
There he is.

1055
01:19:11,210 --> 01:19:12,070
Right in the foot.

1056
01:19:15,270 --> 01:19:17,230
Hey, we got bones now if we find dogs.

1057
01:19:19,550 --> 01:19:20,430
What is that?

1058
01:19:23,990 --> 01:19:25,370
He dropped wheat?!

1059
01:19:28,230 --> 01:19:29,050
What the hell?

1060
01:19:30,770 --> 01:19:32,310
Why would you have weed inside of you?

1061
01:19:34,610 --> 01:19:35,350
That's weird.

1062
01:19:37,710 --> 01:19:38,890
Okay, I'm starting timer.

1063
01:19:40,070 --> 01:19:41,010
20 minutes to go.

1064
01:19:44,250 --> 01:19:45,770
From now on, everything counts.

1065
01:19:57,680 --> 01:20:01,220
Imagine how mad people are gonna be if there's an eagle on my screen and I don't see it.

1066
01:20:14,140 --> 01:20:14,860
That's a village.

1067
01:20:28,620 --> 01:20:31,820
I feel like I need to be not at tree level, but like lower.

1068
01:20:35,420 --> 01:20:41,520
So I can really notice... Oh, then again, it's also kind of hard to see things here.

1069
01:20:42,920 --> 01:20:44,000
I'm scanning everything.

1070
01:20:58,890 --> 01:21:00,770
This is what they call a snowshoe rabbit, I believe.

1071
01:21:10,150 --> 01:21:11,270
That's the hole I went inside.

1072
01:21:30,350 --> 01:21:31,270
Okay, you get to live.

1073
01:21:36,990 --> 01:21:37,550
Come on, man.

1074
01:21:37,650 --> 01:21:38,070
Igloo me.

1075
01:21:40,430 --> 01:21:41,110
I need it.

1076
01:21:55,330 --> 01:21:58,970
The thing is though, this region is like half snow, half... green.

1077
01:21:59,210 --> 01:22:02,650
So I don't know if that actually... is where the igloo could spawn.

1078
01:22:10,630 --> 01:22:12,350
Maybe it needs to be in the full snow region.

1079
01:22:34,600 --> 01:22:35,920
Oh no, we're running out of snow.

1080
01:22:38,560 --> 01:22:39,720
Let's go up top of that mountain.

1081
01:22:40,160 --> 01:22:41,000
I have a good feeling.

1082
01:22:42,380 --> 01:22:44,680
Hopefully we're going to see a Winter Wonderland on the other side.

1083
01:22:47,280 --> 01:22:49,420
Because believe it or not, I want to find this igloo.

1084
01:23:19,680 --> 01:23:20,740
Surely up here, right?

1085
01:23:28,460 --> 01:23:29,520
Winter Wonderland!

1086
01:23:29,680 --> 01:23:30,140
Okay, okay.

1087
01:23:30,440 --> 01:23:31,400
We got chances, guys.

1088
01:23:32,860 --> 01:23:34,140
It's a big snow region.

1089
01:23:35,940 --> 01:23:36,900
This could be it.

1090
01:23:49,900 --> 01:23:50,660
Is that it?

1091
01:23:50,820 --> 01:23:51,020
Wait.

1092
01:23:52,500 --> 01:23:53,540
I may have found it.

1093
01:23:55,980 --> 01:23:57,040
Could that be it?

1094
01:23:58,540 --> 01:23:59,960
That kind of looks like it.

1095
01:24:01,920 --> 01:24:02,960
Let me go confirm.

1096
01:24:12,900 --> 01:24:15,900
That looked like a lot of snow in a very small space.

1097
01:24:30,190 --> 01:24:33,250
If that actually turns out to be an igloo, you can call me Eagle Eye Alan.

1098
01:24:39,810 --> 01:24:42,230
Oh, it definitely is!

1099
01:24:43,690 --> 01:24:44,490
Right?

1100
01:24:47,190 --> 01:24:47,990
Haha!

1101
01:24:48,570 --> 01:24:49,690
Alright, man!

1102
01:24:50,330 --> 01:24:52,070
That's definitely a yep.

1103
01:24:53,830 --> 01:24:55,010
There we go.

1104
01:24:55,410 --> 01:24:55,950
Oh, man.

1105
01:24:56,450 --> 01:24:57,630
That's lovely, that.

1106
01:24:58,370 --> 01:24:59,510
That's lovely.

1107
01:25:00,850 --> 01:25:01,990
Go to bed.

1108
01:25:02,390 --> 01:25:03,150
Let me see.

1109
01:25:04,630 --> 01:25:05,370
Yes!

1110
01:25:07,260 --> 01:25:09,120
My prayers have been answered, guys.

1111
01:25:09,320 --> 01:25:10,180
This is it.

1112
01:25:15,320 --> 01:25:16,180
Let's have a look.

1113
01:25:32,220 --> 01:25:33,720
Fuck, it's not showing me...

1114
01:25:40,640 --> 01:25:42,660
It's not showing me ingredient, though!

1115
01:25:49,900 --> 01:25:50,480
Oh, no!

1116
01:25:57,260 --> 01:25:59,100
Hey, I can take that with me home.

1117
01:26:00,060 --> 01:26:00,420
Yeah.

1118
01:26:01,180 --> 01:26:03,040
Actually, yeah, I'm taking that with me home, of course.

1119
01:26:03,560 --> 01:26:03,920
Easy.

1120
01:26:04,920 --> 01:26:05,280
Yep.

1121
01:26:07,080 --> 01:26:08,260
Guys, good luck.

1122
01:26:12,980 --> 01:26:13,560
Fuck him!

1123
01:26:15,520 --> 01:26:16,660
I'm leaving him behind.

1124
01:26:17,640 --> 01:26:19,180
Imagine how long they've been stranded there.

1125
01:26:19,260 --> 01:26:20,560
They finally see someone coming in.

1126
01:26:20,680 --> 01:26:21,300
Oh god, this is it.

1127
01:26:21,560 --> 01:26:22,280
This is it.

1128
01:26:23,000 --> 01:26:23,920
We're getting rescued.

1129
01:26:24,600 --> 01:26:26,880
Comes down there, steals the potion, and leaves.

1130
01:26:29,220 --> 01:26:31,520
That must be so demoralizing.

1131
01:26:32,400 --> 01:26:33,320
I'm sorry!

1132
01:26:34,080 --> 01:26:34,720
I'm not.

1133
01:26:36,860 --> 01:26:38,660
Guys, what about second igloo?

1134
01:26:53,060 --> 01:26:54,700
Can you see the igloo?

1135
01:26:57,920 --> 01:26:58,980
I can't tell.

1136
01:27:02,280 --> 01:27:03,340
Let's keep watching.

1137
01:27:13,080 --> 01:27:14,140
I'll go over here.

1138
01:27:15,300 --> 01:27:17,320
Kind of want to make another igloo gamble.

1139
01:27:19,840 --> 01:27:21,820
Would be nice to get two of these potions.

1140
01:27:23,840 --> 01:27:24,360
Okay.

1141
01:27:24,680 --> 01:27:25,900
We make another igloo gamble.

1142
01:27:27,720 --> 01:27:29,280
What about second igloo?

1143
01:27:31,260 --> 01:27:32,000
Oh yeah.

1144
01:27:32,580 --> 01:27:33,320
No way.

1145
01:27:35,000 --> 01:27:35,680
Good luck.

1146
01:27:36,820 --> 01:27:38,060
This is way too much fun.

1147
01:27:38,140 --> 01:27:39,160
I love the prediction stuff.

1148
01:27:40,220 --> 01:27:41,060
This is great.

1149
01:27:42,260 --> 01:27:43,660
We're going for a second, Igloo.

1150
01:27:46,260 --> 01:27:51,960
I'm gonna get up top here, though, and look around the area I looked in just before, because I think there may be more there.

1151
01:28:01,720 --> 01:28:05,740
And then we also got to go to another cave and get some more iron, because we haven't gotten enough yet for the factory.

1152
01:28:08,180 --> 01:28:09,500
So there was an eagle there.

1153
01:28:32,340 --> 01:28:37,460
Not seeing anything... yet.

1154
01:28:40,220 --> 01:28:41,960
Okay, let me put the timer.

1155
01:28:43,680 --> 01:28:45,040
It's 20 minutes, of course.

1156
01:28:45,660 --> 01:28:46,800
20 minutes, go.

1157
01:28:48,700 --> 01:28:50,000
Alright, wish me luck.

1158
01:28:50,560 --> 01:28:51,720
Let's go igloo hunting.

1159
01:28:52,200 --> 01:28:54,280
I need another potion of splash weakness.

1160
01:28:58,420 --> 01:29:00,400
I'll have to splash some weakness on my enemies.

1161
01:29:02,620 --> 01:29:04,060
I will murder animals.

1162
01:29:05,160 --> 01:29:06,900
That's just the kind of guy I am.

1163
01:29:06,980 --> 01:29:07,860
I like to do that.

1164
01:29:10,880 --> 01:29:11,740
Brings me pleasure.

1165
01:29:14,020 --> 01:29:15,420
Let me try this side over here.

1166
01:29:32,470 --> 01:29:35,090
I feel like we need another big open area I can scan, you know?

1167
01:29:35,270 --> 01:29:35,830
That's the key.

1168
01:29:39,650 --> 01:29:40,970
Oh, and we gotta look for carrots.

1169
01:29:42,330 --> 01:29:44,190
Who knows, maybe there's gonna be carrots here.

1170
01:29:44,630 --> 01:29:44,970
Somewhere.

1171
01:29:46,530 --> 01:29:47,750
Oh, more ice over there!

1172
01:29:47,830 --> 01:29:48,770
That's good, that's good.

1173
01:29:59,470 --> 01:30:00,430
Let me have a look at that.

1174
01:30:12,820 --> 01:30:13,800
I have a good feeling.

1175
01:30:18,840 --> 01:30:24,120
I wonder if the igloo can be inside a mountain or in a cave if we're in the snow biome.

1176
01:30:25,980 --> 01:30:28,840
Or if it's only gonna, you know, manifest itself on the surface.

1177
01:30:33,180 --> 01:30:35,820
My gut instinct tells me it's only gonna be on the surface.

1178
01:30:42,000 --> 01:30:42,740
I need to go to bed.

1179
01:30:45,940 --> 01:30:46,620
Oh, there it is.

1180
01:30:46,940 --> 01:30:47,840
I thought I left it behind.

1181
01:31:00,200 --> 01:31:00,680
Oh shit!

1182
01:31:06,180 --> 01:31:09,940
In fact, I'm gonna explore this a little more before I head to that other mountain.

1183
01:31:10,780 --> 01:31:12,120
Please don't let me sink in this.

1184
01:31:18,460 --> 01:31:18,900
Wow!

1185
01:31:19,260 --> 01:31:19,940
Nice dodge.

1186
01:31:37,140 --> 01:31:38,200
Let's climb up to the top.

1187
01:31:40,880 --> 01:31:41,640
Take a look around.

1188
01:32:10,890 --> 01:32:12,030
I gotta be like that.

1189
01:32:28,730 --> 01:32:30,030
Come on, show me that igloo.

1190
01:32:30,990 --> 01:32:33,250
Would be cool to get home with two potions of weakness.

1191
01:32:33,730 --> 01:32:36,730
Just so we have an extra for another village that we find, you know?

1192
01:32:45,940 --> 01:32:46,320
Whoa!

1193
01:32:46,320 --> 01:32:46,700
Ooh.

1194
01:32:48,580 --> 01:32:51,300
If this was close to home, I would have tried to bring them with me home.

1195
01:32:57,120 --> 01:32:58,560
I'm not seeing anything.

1196
01:33:02,740 --> 01:33:03,860
What did he drop?

1197
01:33:12,160 --> 01:33:13,760
You don't drop any meat for me.

1198
01:33:15,700 --> 01:33:16,800
Hey, do you like this?

1199
01:33:18,440 --> 01:33:19,900
They like wheat!

1200
01:33:28,580 --> 01:33:29,260
Stay mad.

1201
01:33:46,460 --> 01:33:48,660
I'm not seeing an igloo here.

1202
01:33:53,900 --> 01:33:56,520
What the hell was that?

1203
01:33:58,160 --> 01:33:59,140
Did you see that?

1204
01:34:01,320 --> 01:34:02,460
This guy can jump.

1205
01:34:03,880 --> 01:34:05,260
I did not do anything.

1206
01:34:05,440 --> 01:34:06,540
He did that all on his own.

1207
01:34:07,860 --> 01:34:09,340
Why can't they jump so high?

1208
01:34:17,090 --> 01:34:18,050
That's weird.

1209
01:34:19,730 --> 01:34:20,690
More snow!

1210
01:34:31,750 --> 01:34:32,390
Nothing.

1211
01:34:37,210 --> 01:34:38,690
Let's explore the top of this.

1212
01:34:39,010 --> 01:34:40,170
It's a very cool mountain.

1213
01:34:40,630 --> 01:34:41,910
I dig this view.

1214
01:34:49,010 --> 01:34:55,050
I'm actually tempted to make these beacons of Gondor, like I did in Season 2 again, because I just love them so much.

1215
01:34:58,630 --> 01:34:59,870
And it's great for navigation.

1216
01:35:18,240 --> 01:35:19,680
Nothing out of the ordinary.

1217
01:35:22,700 --> 01:35:25,920
But hey, we found the biome to look for igloos, right?

1218
01:35:30,260 --> 01:35:32,600
It's actually an insane biome.

1219
01:35:34,320 --> 01:35:37,060
We found the spot of all spots, for sure.

1220
01:35:55,300 --> 01:35:55,780
Man.

1221
01:35:55,780 --> 01:35:56,860
Man, I love Minecraft.

1222
01:35:57,000 --> 01:35:58,200
This is just so relaxing, isn't it?

1223
01:36:01,360 --> 01:36:02,100
So nice.

1224
01:36:05,800 --> 01:36:06,720
More snow!

1225
01:36:27,350 --> 01:36:29,250
Can the igloos even be on a mountain?

1226
01:36:29,990 --> 01:36:30,710
I wonder.

1227
01:36:53,750 --> 01:36:54,930
Let's check the left side.

1228
01:37:03,140 --> 01:37:04,620
Do we see anything here?

1229
01:37:04,740 --> 01:37:07,240
I'm really, like, leaning into the monitor right now.

1230
01:37:11,200 --> 01:37:11,720
Scanning.

1231
01:37:18,320 --> 01:37:19,200
Nothing there.

1232
01:37:22,860 --> 01:37:26,200
Okay, I'm gonna jump off this mountain and fly.

1233
01:37:28,740 --> 01:37:29,600
Durability is good.

1234
01:37:42,690 --> 01:37:43,650
Let's get up here.

1235
01:37:48,170 --> 01:37:49,730
There's lots of snow here.

1236
01:37:51,250 --> 01:37:53,250
I mean, this would be the area to find it.

1237
01:37:56,170 --> 01:37:56,650
Right?

1238
01:37:58,450 --> 01:38:00,510
This is truly winter wonderland.

1239
01:38:34,750 --> 01:38:36,710
Ooh, this is actually a great vantage point.

1240
01:38:38,070 --> 01:38:39,770
For finding igloos in the forest.

1241
01:38:40,330 --> 01:38:41,670
I get to see most of it, see?

1242
01:38:45,530 --> 01:38:48,150
Does this almost look like an isometric game from this angle?

1243
01:38:48,510 --> 01:38:49,790
When you look down like this?

1244
01:38:51,450 --> 01:38:52,150
Look at it.

1245
01:38:53,950 --> 01:38:56,170
Can you imagine walking a character around down there?

1246
01:38:58,570 --> 01:38:59,250
That's nice.

1247
01:39:01,410 --> 01:39:02,350
Let's check this side.

1248
01:39:14,840 --> 01:39:16,080
So much snow.

1249
01:39:16,820 --> 01:39:17,920
What's the timer at?

1250
01:39:19,120 --> 01:39:21,040
Nine minutes, so a little over halfway.

1251
01:39:22,720 --> 01:39:24,480
I'm confident we're gonna find one.

1252
01:39:35,700 --> 01:39:38,960
Like... It's gotta be here somewhere.

1253
01:39:59,400 --> 01:40:01,820
In all this open landscape, there's nothing, huh?

1254
01:40:06,600 --> 01:40:08,920
I'm gonna jump off and fly that way, I think.

1255
01:40:20,670 --> 01:40:22,370
Maybe I'll quickly say hi to these guys.

1256
01:40:23,610 --> 01:40:25,250
By the way, this doesn't count.

1257
01:40:25,610 --> 01:40:26,650
It's gotta be a real one.

1258
01:40:28,430 --> 01:40:29,870
These are just their houses here.

1259
01:40:31,350 --> 01:40:32,950
This is a fake igloo.

1260
01:40:33,390 --> 01:40:33,810
Figloo.

1261
01:40:38,990 --> 01:40:39,730
Kitty cat.

1262
01:40:40,790 --> 01:40:41,870
Kitty kitty, kitty cat.

1263
01:40:46,640 --> 01:40:48,220
I got no fish, I'm sorry.

1264
01:40:49,360 --> 01:40:51,240
In fact, I've done very little fishing.

1265
01:40:58,580 --> 01:41:00,040
I don't want to spend too much time here.

1266
01:41:02,660 --> 01:41:03,920
We got igloos to find.

1267
01:41:09,860 --> 01:41:10,420
Wake up!

1268
01:41:11,620 --> 01:41:12,700
I don't actually want anything.

1269
01:41:12,900 --> 01:41:13,840
I'm just messing with you.

1270
01:41:17,220 --> 01:41:17,840
Get up!

1271
01:41:18,060 --> 01:41:18,880
I need to sleep.

1272
01:41:25,700 --> 01:41:26,460
There you.

1273
01:41:32,920 --> 01:41:33,940
Go this way now.

1274
01:41:34,440 --> 01:41:35,220
Hope for an igloo.

1275
01:41:49,360 --> 01:41:50,640
Let's get up there and look around.

1276
01:41:58,700 --> 01:42:01,940
This is probably the biggest snowy region I've seen in this game as well.

1277
01:42:02,300 --> 01:42:05,560
We've had the biggest ocean region, now the biggest snow region.

1278
01:42:08,460 --> 01:42:09,760
That I have ever seen.

1279
01:42:11,200 --> 01:42:11,980
In Minecraft.

1280
01:42:15,830 --> 01:42:20,570
Now, if you think about it, I've only seen, like, five or so worlds of this game.

1281
01:42:21,810 --> 01:42:22,690
So it's not surprising.

1282
01:42:22,910 --> 01:42:24,430
Well, I guess I had a couple in Hardcore.

1283
01:42:46,500 --> 01:42:47,640
Is there an igloo here?

1284
01:42:47,860 --> 01:42:49,220
Ooh, there's a lot of snow though!

1285
01:43:17,390 --> 01:43:20,170
Like, what would you do without the Spyglass, honestly?

1286
01:43:23,430 --> 01:43:25,110
This would be impossible without it.

1287
01:43:38,030 --> 01:43:38,530
What?

1288
01:43:38,630 --> 01:43:39,050
What's that?

1289
01:43:45,220 --> 01:43:46,400
Guys, I'm losing faith.

1290
01:43:46,680 --> 01:43:47,940
We can't find another one.

1291
01:43:50,060 --> 01:43:52,680
Would love to get an extra potion with me home.

1292
01:43:54,680 --> 01:43:55,980
Looks like it's gonna happen.

1293
01:44:13,110 --> 01:44:20,370
I think the plan is, if I don't find an igloo, we're gonna start walking home, but we're gonna go through the nether.

1294
01:44:20,890 --> 01:44:22,330
So I'll find a portal.

1295
01:44:46,150 --> 01:44:47,090
Nothing that way.

1296
01:45:04,550 --> 01:45:05,370
I'm gonna fly.

1297
01:45:20,600 --> 01:45:22,180
This would be the place to have a boat.

1298
01:45:26,820 --> 01:45:28,340
But I gotta stay in here.

1299
01:45:31,480 --> 01:45:33,220
Man, these things are rare.

1300
01:45:36,000 --> 01:45:36,500
Wow.

1301
01:45:38,280 --> 01:45:39,280
All this snow.

1302
01:46:04,060 --> 01:46:05,080
Yeah, I'm gonna make a boat.

1303
01:46:08,680 --> 01:46:11,420
I hate this tree.

1304
01:46:27,680 --> 01:46:28,640
Oh, snow.

1305
01:46:31,340 --> 01:46:34,120
Boat is like... Yeah, dude, did you see that?

1306
01:46:36,620 --> 01:46:38,360
I know my crafting recipes.

1307
01:46:46,300 --> 01:46:47,920
I'm gonna get a vantage point here.

1308
01:46:52,040 --> 01:46:52,800
Ice drift.

1309
01:47:01,990 --> 01:47:02,910
Let's get up there.

1310
01:47:10,710 --> 01:47:12,590
Give me my dirt.

1311
01:47:27,450 --> 01:47:29,990
Are we... No, dude, look at all that snow we have, man.

1312
01:47:30,150 --> 01:47:31,810
We're gonna find an igloo here, surely.

1313
01:47:33,070 --> 01:47:34,650
What is that mountain?

1314
01:47:39,170 --> 01:47:40,730
The hell is that?

1315
01:47:42,170 --> 01:47:43,130
You kidding me?

1316
01:47:48,900 --> 01:47:51,360
Dude, this is like the biggest snowy region of all time.

1317
01:47:53,160 --> 01:47:54,260
How much time do we have left?

1318
01:47:55,920 --> 01:47:56,980
50 seconds, dude.

1319
01:47:58,060 --> 01:47:59,020
Yeah, I think we're cooked.

1320
01:48:02,000 --> 01:48:02,400
Unfortunately.

1321
01:48:04,900 --> 01:48:05,860
I'm not gonna make it.

1322
01:48:08,580 --> 01:48:09,180
Oh, wait.

1323
01:48:09,400 --> 01:48:10,980
Is that a fucking igloo right there?!

1324
01:48:19,900 --> 01:48:21,080
It is an igloo!

1325
01:48:21,280 --> 01:48:21,560
Yes!

1326
01:48:21,740 --> 01:48:22,200
Oh my god.

1327
01:48:22,980 --> 01:48:23,440
Believers.

1328
01:48:25,300 --> 01:48:26,380
Oh yeah.

1329
01:48:27,900 --> 01:48:28,840
Oh yeah.

1330
01:48:29,740 --> 01:48:30,300
Now.

1331
01:48:30,960 --> 01:48:32,900
We're gonna make a separate prediction now.

1332
01:48:33,040 --> 01:48:33,380
Get ready.

1333
01:48:35,440 --> 01:48:37,520
Is there a ladder?

1334
01:48:39,140 --> 01:48:39,740
Yes.

1335
01:48:40,220 --> 01:48:40,780
Nope.

1336
01:48:41,640 --> 01:48:42,180
30 seconds.

1337
01:48:42,300 --> 01:48:42,420
Go!

1338
01:48:42,540 --> 01:48:42,680
Quick!

1339
01:48:43,600 --> 01:48:45,700
I wanna see big gambles on this one.

1340
01:48:47,840 --> 01:48:49,740
Oh, the timer just ran out.

1341
01:48:50,200 --> 01:48:50,980
That's crazy, bro.

1342
01:48:52,300 --> 01:48:53,200
That was close.

1343
01:48:54,540 --> 01:48:54,980
Wow.

1344
01:48:56,220 --> 01:48:59,320
I knew we had to find another one in a region such as this one.

1345
01:48:59,420 --> 01:49:00,200
That was so big.

1346
01:49:03,380 --> 01:49:04,480
Get rid of that one, too.

1347
01:49:08,240 --> 01:49:09,160
Get ready, man.

1348
01:49:18,150 --> 01:49:19,010
Are you ready?

1349
01:49:19,810 --> 01:49:23,270
Let me see, is the thing... Okay, here we go.

1350
01:49:26,990 --> 01:49:28,510
There is a ladder!

1351
01:49:29,270 --> 01:49:30,770
Would you look at that?

1352
01:49:31,450 --> 01:49:33,010
There is indeed a ladder.

1353
01:49:33,670 --> 01:49:34,810
That is a yes.

1354
01:49:40,530 --> 01:49:41,770
Very nice.

1355
01:49:45,780 --> 01:49:48,640
We're just gambling on everything in this game at this point.

1356
01:49:50,500 --> 01:49:52,900
Yeah, we got another one.

1357
