1638
02:09:07,180 --> 02:09:08,640
Ooh, we got dudes back there!

1639
02:09:15,830 --> 02:09:16,470
What's that?

1640
02:09:18,310 --> 02:09:18,970
It's green.

1641
02:09:26,070 --> 02:09:26,710
One down.

1642
02:09:29,750 --> 02:09:31,630
Everyone we kill is actually so massive.

1643
02:09:35,910 --> 02:09:36,810
Can I come up here?

1644
02:09:41,750 --> 02:09:42,910
Another one.

1645
02:09:43,490 --> 02:09:44,530
Another one too.

1646
02:09:57,070 --> 02:09:58,510
What a shot.

1647
02:09:59,490 --> 02:10:00,390
Get fucked.

1648
02:10:03,350 --> 02:10:04,350
There's another guy here.

1649
02:10:06,910 --> 02:10:07,570
There he is.

1650
02:10:07,950 --> 02:10:08,650
Hasn't seen me.

1651
02:10:10,910 --> 02:10:11,950
You're dead, son.

1652
02:10:13,550 --> 02:10:14,770
Yeah, you're dead.

1653
02:10:16,350 --> 02:10:16,750
Sweet.

1654
02:10:19,670 --> 02:10:20,790
I think there's a guy upstairs.

1655
02:10:20,950 --> 02:10:21,350
I saw him.

1656
02:10:22,030 --> 02:10:23,450
In fact, let's go up and join him.

1657
02:10:26,810 --> 02:10:32,930
Did I throw away some... I need more... blocks.

1658
02:10:35,830 --> 02:10:37,370
I think they despawned.

1659
02:10:37,490 --> 02:10:37,770
Damn.

1660
02:10:39,450 --> 02:10:40,910
Guess I can just grab more.

1661
02:10:42,490 --> 02:10:43,450
I'll grab some.

1662
02:10:54,460 --> 02:10:54,860
Good.

1663
02:10:54,860 --> 02:10:55,740
Clean the inventory.

1664
02:11:05,540 --> 02:11:06,800
Stop picking it up again.

1665
02:11:10,780 --> 02:11:12,520
I don't know what I want... Oh, okay.

1666
02:11:12,720 --> 02:11:14,180
Turn these into...

1667
02:11:21,380 --> 02:11:23,300
Come on, I need to do this.

1668
02:11:41,960 --> 02:11:42,880
How am I missing?

1669
02:11:48,900 --> 02:11:49,980
That guy is friendly.

1670
02:11:54,950 --> 02:11:56,770
I saw one right up here, I believe.

1671
02:12:00,010 --> 02:12:03,210
Okay, he's friendly.

1672
02:12:03,510 --> 02:12:03,750
Friendly?

1673
02:12:05,770 --> 02:12:06,810
There could be another one.

1674
02:12:29,910 --> 02:12:30,590
Good.

1675
02:12:30,590 --> 02:12:32,010
Eliminate all dangers.

1676
02:12:37,330 --> 02:12:39,110
I'm going down one level here.

1677
02:12:42,890 --> 02:12:44,830
Everyone seems friendly so far.

1678
02:12:48,390 --> 02:12:50,690
We may have actually cleared everything.

1679
02:12:52,190 --> 02:12:53,450
I see a chest.

1680
02:12:57,980 --> 02:12:58,920
Let's go check it out.

1681
02:13:06,500 --> 02:13:07,120
There it is.

1682
02:13:08,980 --> 02:13:10,580
If I jump down, I need a way out.

1683
02:13:17,980 --> 02:13:19,220
Just be ready to make a tower.

1684
02:13:24,230 --> 02:13:24,750
Warpix.

1685
02:13:26,890 --> 02:13:29,670
It's a very expensive barbecue place in Copenhagen.

1686
02:13:50,050 --> 02:13:50,890
Hey, come here!

1687
02:13:58,280 --> 02:13:59,020
Okay, he's dead.

1688
02:13:59,700 --> 02:14:00,520
He's dead, good.

1689
02:14:07,220 --> 02:14:09,080
Man, where are all the chests at?

1690
02:14:10,640 --> 02:14:12,520
Shouldn't there be, like, way more chests here?

1691
02:14:34,480 --> 02:14:35,360
Bad guys?

1692
02:14:36,620 --> 02:14:37,700
They're good guys.

1693
02:14:44,060 --> 02:14:44,700
Chest.

1694
02:14:46,580 --> 02:14:47,360
Who's that?

1695
02:14:48,820 --> 02:14:50,320
Are you a bad guy?

1696
02:14:53,220 --> 02:14:54,240
Are you a bad guy?

1697
02:14:57,250 --> 02:14:58,090
I can't tell.

1698
02:14:58,330 --> 02:15:03,350
Show me your... You're trapped, aren't you?

1699
02:15:06,130 --> 02:15:06,610
Bastard.

1700
02:15:10,130 --> 02:15:11,230
I hear people running.

1701
02:15:18,010 --> 02:15:18,490
Fuck.

1702
02:15:22,130 --> 02:15:22,610
Shit.

1703
02:15:23,890 --> 02:15:25,110
Oh, you're all gonna die.

1704
02:15:37,080 --> 02:15:37,760
Where are you?

1705
02:15:39,820 --> 02:15:40,700
Oh, you're a friend.

1706
02:15:41,580 --> 02:15:43,520
But why were you chasing me like I wasn't a friend?

1707
02:15:44,240 --> 02:15:44,440
Huh?

1708
02:15:44,620 --> 02:15:44,800
Huh?

1709
02:15:44,940 --> 02:15:45,100
Huh?

1710
02:15:50,060 --> 02:15:51,180
Oh my god.

1711
02:15:53,040 --> 02:15:53,920
I'm gonna jump down.

1712
02:15:57,040 --> 02:15:57,580
We good?

1713
02:15:58,920 --> 02:15:59,840
Hello, hello, hello.

1714
02:16:00,220 --> 02:16:00,940
Come take me.

1715
02:16:01,300 --> 02:16:02,060
Come take me.

1716
02:16:03,220 --> 02:16:04,160
I'm opening the chest.

1717
02:16:11,480 --> 02:16:12,920
We fucking get me out of here.

1718
02:16:13,520 --> 02:16:14,060
I'm leaving.

1719
02:16:14,720 --> 02:16:15,320
I'm leaving.

1720
02:16:21,940 --> 02:16:23,560
There's one unfortunate thing to all of this.

1721
02:16:24,940 --> 02:16:26,380
Which is, I don't remember where I came from.

1722
02:16:28,420 --> 02:16:29,020
Actually, I do.

1723
02:16:29,120 --> 02:16:30,860
We can probably trace our steps here.

1724
02:16:36,960 --> 02:16:38,020
I came from here, right?

1725
02:16:47,410 --> 02:16:48,870
I need to find the tunnel I made.

1726
02:16:56,670 --> 02:17:00,030
I came from there, which means it's like that way home, right?

1727
02:17:01,030 --> 02:17:04,650
So what I really need is to find... Oh, I didn't think about this, guys!

1728
02:17:05,950 --> 02:17:07,110
I need obsidian!

1729
02:17:08,070 --> 02:17:08,510
Shit!

1730
02:17:14,170 --> 02:17:15,450
How am I gonna find that?

1731
02:17:19,770 --> 02:17:20,310
Uh-oh.

1732
02:17:23,530 --> 02:17:24,870
I'm gonna have to find a portal.

1733
02:17:26,270 --> 02:17:27,050
Actually, wait.

1734
02:17:27,430 --> 02:17:29,170
We may have some in the contraption.

1735
02:17:30,770 --> 02:17:31,670
Dear God, come on.

1736
02:17:32,950 --> 02:17:33,710
Be good to me.

1737
02:17:35,590 --> 02:17:37,610
Are you gonna get mad that I opened these chests here?

1738
02:17:37,710 --> 02:17:38,930
You don't like when I open things, right?

1739
02:17:41,050 --> 02:17:41,550
Are you okay?

1740
02:17:43,130 --> 02:17:43,850
We're good, okay.

1741
02:17:46,910 --> 02:17:47,730
Show me obsidian.

1742
02:17:55,030 --> 02:17:56,450
We found ancient debris!

1743
02:17:57,210 --> 02:17:58,090
That's crazy!

1744
02:17:59,070 --> 02:18:02,230
Maybe that's what took so long for the digging just before.

1745
02:18:04,210 --> 02:18:06,010
Okay, well, no obsidian.

1746
02:18:08,510 --> 02:18:08,950
Okay.

1747
02:18:09,870 --> 02:18:11,970
Part of me wants to raise the rest of their shit here.

1748
02:18:13,830 --> 02:18:14,470
You know what?

1749
02:18:14,490 --> 02:18:15,770
I'm not done with this bastion.

1750
02:18:15,910 --> 02:18:16,890
I'm going back in.

1751
02:18:18,350 --> 02:18:19,770
I could find obsidian, right?

1752
02:18:24,100 --> 02:18:25,080
We're not done here.

1753
02:18:34,220 --> 02:18:36,040
We killed most of the bad guys anyway.

1754
02:18:47,280 --> 02:18:48,340
There's a pig here somewhere.

1755
02:18:50,360 --> 02:18:51,100
Are you friendly?

1756
02:18:53,800 --> 02:18:54,700
Where art thou?

1757
02:18:54,820 --> 02:18:54,940
Oh!

1758
02:18:55,380 --> 02:18:56,700
You're friendly, I think.

1759
02:18:57,840 --> 02:18:59,320
You seemed friendly to me.

1760
02:19:01,120 --> 02:19:02,440
You are friendly, right?

1761
02:19:02,740 --> 02:19:03,180
Are you friendly?

1762
02:19:03,420 --> 02:19:03,840
You are.

1763
02:19:05,260 --> 02:19:07,000
Now, what if I were to go deeper down?

1764
02:19:14,390 --> 02:19:19,930
No, no, let's not... Okay, keep going.

1765
02:19:27,350 --> 02:19:28,210
Well, that was cool.

1766
02:19:28,370 --> 02:19:29,910
We've actually found a bastion quite fast.

1767
02:19:30,550 --> 02:19:32,670
And we got the... Is it called a template?

1768
02:19:34,250 --> 02:19:34,890
It is indeed.

1769
02:19:35,170 --> 02:19:35,350
Template.

1770
02:19:35,650 --> 02:19:36,290
Netherite template.

1771
02:19:40,890 --> 02:19:43,130
Man, the fall is gonna be even harder if I die now.

1772
02:19:44,130 --> 02:19:45,470
So tragic if I die now.

1773
02:19:47,990 --> 02:19:50,610
I don't know if I could recover from it if I die now.

1774
02:19:55,750 --> 02:19:57,010
We gotta find some obsidian.

1775
02:20:01,970 --> 02:20:04,450
If only I had water with me in here, huh?

1776
02:20:04,950 --> 02:20:07,190
Then I could have made obsidian any time I wanted.

1777
02:20:08,990 --> 02:20:10,150
That's not the case, though.

1778
02:20:12,250 --> 02:20:14,350
I do have a elytra on.

1779
02:20:14,510 --> 02:20:15,170
Let's not forget.

1780
02:20:27,880 --> 02:20:28,320
Wow.

1781
02:20:29,280 --> 02:20:30,440
I do a lot of damage.

1782
02:20:35,040 --> 02:20:38,540
Also, I should really stick to my straight line that way.

1783
02:20:55,520 --> 02:20:57,760
Now, I think the smartest move is actually to go back.

1784
02:20:58,600 --> 02:20:59,860
If I'm being completely honest.

1785
02:21:02,160 --> 02:21:04,440
But that's like a coward move, isn't it?

1786
02:21:14,300 --> 02:21:15,320
Wait, why are they afraid?

1787
02:21:28,570 --> 02:21:29,370
Yeah, that's right.

1788
02:21:29,490 --> 02:21:29,970
You better run.

1789
02:21:33,710 --> 02:21:34,870
I'm the pig killer.

1790
02:21:36,010 --> 02:21:37,450
I killed all your friends.

1791
02:21:45,960 --> 02:21:47,600
Okay, now I should just go that way.

1792
02:21:49,220 --> 02:21:50,780
So maybe we do an SLJ here.

1793
02:21:52,160 --> 02:21:54,940
But these... oh man, this area is treacherous.

1794
02:21:56,400 --> 02:21:57,280
Too much lava.

1795
02:22:00,400 --> 02:22:01,340
The hell is that?

1796
02:22:04,600 --> 02:22:05,040
Scorchia.

1797
02:22:15,420 --> 02:22:19,300
So there's something called Scoria, and if you add black dye to it, you get Scorchia.

1798
02:22:20,380 --> 02:22:21,320
That's kind of interesting.

1799
02:22:21,880 --> 02:22:24,140
I would say it's mildly interesting, but nothing more than that.

1800
02:22:24,780 --> 02:22:26,020
Yeah, there's too much lava here for me.

1801
02:22:27,400 --> 02:22:30,820
And I don't have enough blocks to SLJ my way out of here.

1802
02:22:33,040 --> 02:22:34,500
Guys, I think we gotta go back.

1803
02:22:37,320 --> 02:22:39,040
Either that, or we commit forward.

1804
02:22:39,500 --> 02:22:40,600
Until we find a portal.

1805
02:22:43,710 --> 02:22:46,370
I mean, all we need is obsidian, right?

1806
02:22:50,170 --> 02:22:51,390
Oh, fuck you.

1807
02:22:54,550 --> 02:22:55,690
Yeah, you better run.

1808
02:23:02,310 --> 02:23:03,130
Guys, I'm gonna go back.

1809
02:23:10,410 --> 02:23:11,850
I'm gonna die in here if I keep going.

1810
02:23:13,970 --> 02:23:15,650
This is me squeezing the lemon.

1811
02:23:16,150 --> 02:23:18,330
Actually, would I even be able to find my way back at this point?

1812
02:23:18,430 --> 02:23:21,490
I feel like... Guys, I fucked myself.

1813
02:23:21,650 --> 02:23:22,690
I can't find my way back.

1814
02:23:24,330 --> 02:23:25,450
How am I all... Wait a minute.

1815
02:23:25,550 --> 02:23:27,210
I need to double check that I didn't miss something.

1816
02:23:27,330 --> 02:23:28,290
Maybe there is something in here.

1817
02:23:29,830 --> 02:23:33,250
Inventory blindness is not the time to suffer from right now, you know?

1818
02:23:33,950 --> 02:23:34,590
You know what I mean?

1819
02:23:46,830 --> 02:23:48,390
Like, there's gotta be some.

1820
02:23:55,130 --> 02:23:55,750
Oh, wait, wait.

1821
02:23:56,690 --> 02:23:57,630
I can make it, right?

1822
02:24:06,510 --> 02:24:08,210
Oh, we can't have water in here, though.

1823
02:24:11,090 --> 02:24:13,430
Man, I guess I couldn't make that anyway in here.

1824
02:24:15,890 --> 02:24:16,650
Oh, shit.

1825
02:24:16,990 --> 02:24:17,290
Hold on.

1826
02:24:36,440 --> 02:24:37,200
No, I need that.

1827
02:24:40,400 --> 02:24:41,220
Oh, man.

1828
02:24:42,780 --> 02:24:43,660
Oh, wait, wait, wait.

1829
02:24:44,040 --> 02:24:45,340
Dude, we can trade with these guys.

1830
02:24:47,320 --> 02:24:48,360
They drop obsidian.

1831
02:24:51,040 --> 02:24:52,340
I've got plenty of gold, too.

1832
02:24:55,620 --> 02:24:56,020
Here.

1833
02:24:57,360 --> 02:24:59,040
I even have gold in my thing.

1834
02:25:00,460 --> 02:25:01,840
In fact, I have two blocks of it.

1835
02:25:06,800 --> 02:25:08,460
Oh-ho-ho-ho-ho, yes!

1836
02:25:12,220 --> 02:25:13,580
But we gotta get lucky here, though.

1837
02:25:14,880 --> 02:25:16,400
Ouch, oh, you little freak.

1838
02:25:25,640 --> 02:25:26,120
Yeah!

1839
02:25:27,760 --> 02:25:30,060
Guys, I think we have our ticket out of here.

1840
02:25:32,280 --> 02:25:33,420
Just clean the inventory.

1841
02:25:35,260 --> 02:25:36,680
Come on, make some for me.

1842
02:25:41,560 --> 02:25:43,060
I wanna... Yes!

1843
02:25:43,500 --> 02:25:44,160
That's two.

1844
02:25:44,440 --> 02:25:45,560
I think we need ten.

1845
02:25:46,200 --> 02:25:46,900
Ten or nine.

1846
02:25:49,040 --> 02:25:50,140
Okay, I'll take those.

1847
02:25:50,460 --> 02:25:51,000
Thank you.

1848
02:25:54,480 --> 02:25:56,140
I forgot I had the extendo grip, actually.

1849
02:25:56,540 --> 02:25:59,440
That's... That would be kind of sick for combat.

1850
02:26:01,260 --> 02:26:02,200
In fact, I'm going to put it on.

1851
02:26:03,380 --> 02:26:04,860
No reason not to have that on right now.

1852
02:26:10,280 --> 02:26:10,800
You know what?

1853
02:26:10,880 --> 02:26:11,220
Actually, no.

1854
02:26:11,420 --> 02:26:15,920
Take it off, because at some point I'm going to try and fly when I don't have my wings on, and I'm going to die.

1855
02:26:17,260 --> 02:26:18,180
I can see it happening.

1856
02:26:20,040 --> 02:26:21,300
Sir, you're not done here.

1857
02:26:21,380 --> 02:26:21,720
You're not done.

1858
02:26:21,800 --> 02:26:22,120
You're not done.

1859
02:26:22,860 --> 02:26:25,060
You need to keep making obsidian for me.

1860
02:26:46,440 --> 02:26:47,980
I don't want to accidentally hit these guys.

1861
02:26:48,120 --> 02:26:49,260
That would be a major disaster.

1862
02:26:50,000 --> 02:26:50,600
Thank you for that.

1863
02:26:50,700 --> 02:26:51,100
Thank you.

1864
02:26:51,180 --> 02:26:51,660
Here, here, here.

1865
02:26:52,320 --> 02:26:53,600
This is your reward.

1866
02:26:53,960 --> 02:26:54,320
Go, go, go.

1867
02:26:56,340 --> 02:26:56,840
Consume it.

1868
02:26:56,940 --> 02:26:58,480
I actually have more gold as well.

1869
02:26:59,840 --> 02:27:01,800
We can make a furnace here.

1870
02:27:02,280 --> 02:27:03,540
And actually turn that into gold.

1871
02:27:08,160 --> 02:27:08,740
Uh-oh.

1872
02:27:10,440 --> 02:27:11,080
Crafting table.

1873
02:27:20,130 --> 02:27:20,890
Oh, shit.

1874
02:27:26,530 --> 02:27:27,770
Guys, we may be cooked.

1875
02:27:35,970 --> 02:27:38,470
How come there's no wood in... Oh, look at all this gold.

1876
02:27:38,490 --> 02:27:39,550
I can't even cook it.

1877
02:27:42,110 --> 02:27:42,950
Oh, that's rough.

1878
02:27:44,750 --> 02:27:46,550
But hold on, maybe I have some in my toolbox.

1879
02:27:57,030 --> 02:27:59,450
Did you give me some obsidian over here?

1880
02:28:01,890 --> 02:28:02,370
One.

1881
02:28:02,690 --> 02:28:03,310
I see one.

1882
02:28:04,730 --> 02:28:06,010
And a fire protection!

1883
02:28:08,110 --> 02:28:09,010
Very nice.

1884
02:28:10,050 --> 02:28:11,030
Big fan of that.

1885
02:28:13,190 --> 02:28:17,310
In fact, I'm gonna drink that... not yet, but soon.

1886
02:28:18,170 --> 02:28:19,750
Let me throw away some of this as well.

1887
02:28:23,800 --> 02:28:26,740
You know what, let's go deposit a bunch into the contraption.

1888
02:28:27,420 --> 02:28:29,820
And while I do that, you guys can suck on that.

1889
02:28:31,060 --> 02:28:31,380
Enjoy.

1890
02:28:35,840 --> 02:28:36,920
Let's go fill this thing up.

1891
02:28:42,640 --> 02:28:43,820
Put all kinds of crap in here.

1892
02:29:02,220 --> 02:29:03,320
Maybe that one as well.

1893
02:29:03,920 --> 02:29:04,280
Sticks.

1894
02:29:05,180 --> 02:29:06,980
Oh, can I turn those into wood, maybe?

1895
02:29:08,220 --> 02:29:09,300
No, I don't think so.

1896
02:29:10,160 --> 02:29:11,520
It only goes one way, doesn't it?

1897
02:29:13,900 --> 02:29:14,960
Tell me... Oh, there we go.

1898
02:29:15,060 --> 02:29:15,340
