Is it day or is it night?

2457
03:07:14,750 --> 03:07:16,510
This is a prediction we're gonna start now.

2458
03:07:17,970 --> 03:07:18,590
Day or night.

2459
03:07:18,630 --> 03:07:19,630
This is the ultimate day or night.

2460
03:07:19,870 --> 03:07:21,210
We have been away for months.

2461
03:07:23,290 --> 03:07:26,150
I was about to say day or night, and answers were yes or no.

2462
03:07:29,430 --> 03:07:29,950
There we go.

2463
03:07:30,050 --> 03:07:30,930
One minute for that one.

2464
03:07:31,010 --> 03:07:31,330
Good luck.

2465
03:07:40,810 --> 03:07:42,170
I need to pick that up, actually.

2466
03:07:47,470 --> 03:07:50,890
If I reach the surface before the thing is done, I'm gonna refund.

2467
03:07:53,730 --> 03:07:54,310
Okay, wait a minute.

2468
03:07:54,350 --> 03:07:55,450
We actually got dirt here.

2469
03:07:55,550 --> 03:07:56,050
I'm gonna wait.

2470
03:07:57,690 --> 03:07:59,870
I'm right next to the surface.

2471
03:08:00,650 --> 03:08:02,510
I wanna see big bets on this one.

2472
03:08:07,250 --> 03:08:08,370
Come on, smartasses.

2473
03:08:15,350 --> 03:08:16,090
Here we go.

2474
03:08:22,750 --> 03:08:23,070
Okay.

2475
03:08:23,990 --> 03:08:29,430
While we wait... throw away some stuff.

2476
03:08:32,570 --> 03:08:34,890
I don't actually care about the leather, because I have so much at home.

2477
03:08:36,970 --> 03:08:38,050
Oh, I should have kept that one.

2478
03:08:38,150 --> 03:08:38,470
That was bad.

2479
03:08:43,340 --> 03:08:44,180
Okay, here we go.

2480
03:08:46,320 --> 03:08:47,420
It's night!

2481
03:08:49,800 --> 03:08:51,040
It is night!

2482
03:08:52,260 --> 03:08:52,740
Oh,

2483
03:08:56,540 --> 03:08:57,280
that's funny.

2484
03:08:57,720 --> 03:08:58,620
Okay, so, compass.

2485
03:08:59,680 --> 03:09:01,000
Let's get home, shall we?

2486
03:09:05,050 --> 03:09:06,310
Are we close to home, though?

2487
03:09:07,190 --> 03:09:11,590
I did take a long trip through the nether there towards home, I believe, so we should be sort of close.

2488
03:09:12,230 --> 03:09:15,370
Oh, I need to kill these so I can get the powder.

2489
03:09:19,190 --> 03:09:20,330
Didn't even drop anything.

2490
03:09:22,170 --> 03:09:23,230
Are you gonna drop something?

2491
03:09:24,270 --> 03:09:24,850
You are.

2492
03:09:26,570 --> 03:09:27,230
Good stuff.

2493
03:09:34,040 --> 03:09:35,560
Got no ascension blocks.

2494
03:09:44,740 --> 03:09:45,580
Oh-ho!

2495
03:09:45,840 --> 03:09:46,260
MLG.

2496
03:09:59,690 --> 03:10:00,630
Hey, I got a boat for you!

2497
03:10:02,370 --> 03:10:03,210
Oh, you don't care.

2498
03:10:03,330 --> 03:10:03,630
Okay, whatever.

2499
03:10:09,950 --> 03:10:10,870
I'm going home.

2500
03:10:17,110 --> 03:10:18,370
And I'm gonna make a boat.

2501
03:10:27,080 --> 03:10:27,660
Watch me.

2502
03:10:29,080 --> 03:10:30,480
Okay, that was pathetic.

2503
03:10:31,920 --> 03:10:32,800
I tried, okay?

2504
03:10:38,540 --> 03:10:42,180
Okay, so snow biome here, that means we're probably not close to home.

2505
03:10:46,280 --> 03:10:48,800
This was such a successful mission.

2506
03:10:49,240 --> 03:10:50,640
We got iron.

2507
03:10:50,880 --> 03:10:52,360
Oh, wait, there's one thing we need.

2508
03:10:52,840 --> 03:10:54,060
We're not done yet, guys.

2509
03:10:54,720 --> 03:10:56,760
There's one thing I have to do before I come home.

2510
03:10:57,240 --> 03:10:58,560
Can you guess what that is?

2511
03:11:00,360 --> 03:11:01,960
Can you guess what it is?

2512
03:11:04,580 --> 03:11:05,580
It's very important.

2513
03:11:07,520 --> 03:11:12,240
It is something you could potentially stick up your butt.

2514
03:11:12,890 --> 03:11:14,410
I wouldn't suggest it, but you could.

2515
03:11:15,290 --> 03:11:16,670
You can also stick it in your mouth.

2516
03:11:17,610 --> 03:11:20,090
And it'll probably be tasty, if you like that sort of thing.

2517
03:11:22,070 --> 03:11:23,230
It is orange.

2518
03:11:25,870 --> 03:11:26,710
Where's my zoomer?

2519
03:11:31,990 --> 03:11:32,970
Wait a minute, what?

2520
03:11:34,970 --> 03:11:35,810
Is that a portal?

2521
03:11:38,150 --> 03:11:39,630
We're not gonna go in there.

2522
03:11:46,280 --> 03:11:47,820
Dude, how am I gonna find a carrot?

2523
03:11:50,040 --> 03:11:51,800
Actually the rarest thing in the game.

2524
03:11:52,860 --> 03:11:55,240
Have I even seen one carrot in this world?

2525
03:11:57,580 --> 03:11:59,580
They don't grow naturally, apparently.

2526
03:12:02,780 --> 03:12:04,800
They're nowhere to be... I need to find a village.

2527
03:12:05,440 --> 03:12:06,620
That's like my best bet.

2528
03:12:08,380 --> 03:12:10,420
The first village I see, I'm gonna raid.

2529
03:12:14,240 --> 03:12:14,720
Dingai?

2530
03:12:27,170 --> 03:12:27,650
Aha!

2531
03:12:30,070 --> 03:12:31,970
I am gonna try and get one of these.

2532
03:12:48,510 --> 03:12:49,190
Oh my god.

2533
03:12:50,810 --> 03:12:51,570
I'm gonna die!

2534
03:12:53,030 --> 03:12:54,310
I cannot die now!

2535
03:12:58,170 --> 03:13:00,830
Get out, get out, get out, get the fuck out of here.

2536
03:13:05,130 --> 03:13:06,430
I'm not doing that.

2537
03:13:06,550 --> 03:13:07,430
I'm not risking it all.

2538
03:13:08,470 --> 03:13:09,450
Absolutely not.

2539
03:13:11,990 --> 03:13:13,730
Dude, I nearly had a heart attack.

2540
03:13:13,890 --> 03:13:14,710
That was so scary.

2541
03:13:15,150 --> 03:13:18,030
If I had died, I think I would have cried in real life.

2542
03:13:19,650 --> 03:13:22,650
It would have been the most devastating loss of all.

2543
03:13:22,830 --> 03:13:24,650
There's no way I would have known where I was.

2544
03:13:26,110 --> 03:13:27,430
Where would I even spawn?

2545
03:13:27,530 --> 03:13:30,210
I would spawn... God knows where.

2546
03:13:31,410 --> 03:13:32,430
In fact...

2547
03:13:36,600 --> 03:13:38,500
Oh my god, the bed is not here.

2548
03:13:42,280 --> 03:13:43,360
I cannot die.

2549
03:13:43,840 --> 03:13:45,320
In fact, I'm gonna put on my tank.

2550
03:13:46,840 --> 03:13:47,320
Protection.

2551
03:13:49,640 --> 03:13:50,120
Protection.

2552
03:13:52,280 --> 03:13:53,280
I'm so scared.

2553
03:13:57,280 --> 03:13:58,320
I'm going home.

2554
03:13:59,480 --> 03:14:00,300
I'm going home.

2555
03:14:02,600 --> 03:14:04,200
But we're gonna get a carrot on the way.

2556
03:14:04,380 --> 03:14:05,540
Like, we're gonna visit the villages.

2557
03:14:07,480 --> 03:14:11,700
If it's the last thing I do... I need it.

2558
03:14:12,180 --> 03:14:15,040
I need that carrot so bad, I wanna farm it.

2559
03:14:25,950 --> 03:14:26,990
This journey, dude.

2560
03:14:28,470 --> 03:14:29,590
It was a rough one.

2561
03:14:32,050 --> 03:14:34,190
I was so close so many times.

2562
03:14:34,590 --> 03:14:36,970
I'm done playing with my life.

2563
03:14:38,610 --> 03:14:40,390
From now on, I'm Mr. Safe.

2564
03:14:41,410 --> 03:14:42,650
We're playing it safe.

2565
03:14:44,130 --> 03:14:44,870
Ooh, wait a minute.

2566
03:14:47,370 --> 03:14:48,470
Wait a second.

2567
03:14:56,390 --> 03:14:57,190
Don't do it.

2568
03:15:01,410 --> 03:15:02,290
Don't be tempted.

2569
03:15:06,810 --> 03:15:09,650
Do not let temptation into your heart.

2570
03:15:15,640 --> 03:15:17,760
Like, actually, where the hell are the carrots?

2571
03:15:18,920 --> 03:15:20,960
Wait, where are the carrots?

2572
03:15:22,120 --> 03:15:26,100
I feel like I have a memory of finding carrots in one of those abandoned towers.

2573
03:15:27,580 --> 03:15:28,760
Maybe that's where I need to look.

2574
03:15:38,710 --> 03:15:41,510
And I could be very... You know what, actually?

2575
03:15:42,690 --> 03:15:44,310
Let me go find some sugarcane.

2576
03:15:45,050 --> 03:15:47,550
Because I have some blast powder.

2577
03:15:48,770 --> 03:15:50,070
In fact, I have a lot, I think.

2578
03:15:50,870 --> 03:15:52,630
We can make flying thingies.

2579
03:15:56,030 --> 03:15:56,490
Sugarcane.

2580
03:15:56,630 --> 03:15:57,510
My game is lagging.

2581
03:15:58,230 --> 03:15:58,970
I see some.

2582
03:16:00,490 --> 03:16:01,110
I think.

2583
03:16:04,500 --> 03:16:05,360
That should be here.

2584
03:16:05,480 --> 03:16:05,900
There we go.

2585
03:16:07,260 --> 03:16:08,080
Sure got a can.

2586
03:16:09,220 --> 03:16:10,480
We're gonna make paper out of that.

2587
03:16:20,340 --> 03:16:20,820
Kidding me.

2588
03:16:23,180 --> 03:16:24,140
Wait, I only have three?

2589
03:16:24,320 --> 03:16:27,180
I must have some in my contraption, right?

2590
03:16:47,260 --> 03:16:48,440
Okay, we got two.

2591
03:16:50,180 --> 03:16:51,140
It's good enough.

2592
03:16:53,040 --> 03:16:54,020
It's good enough.

2593
03:17:00,260 --> 03:17:00,860
Fifteen!

2594
03:17:02,280 --> 03:17:03,640
I'm gonna leave that behind.

2595
03:17:04,380 --> 03:17:05,440
Let's go home!

2596
03:17:08,460 --> 03:17:10,660
Oh, it feels good to fly again.

2597
03:17:17,650 --> 03:17:18,610
Look for villagers.

2598
03:17:21,590 --> 03:17:22,590
On the way home.

2599
03:17:34,450 --> 03:17:37,910
I wish I could sort of look to my side without changing direction of flight.

2600
03:18:06,300 --> 03:18:08,520
Looked like gold from this angle.

2601
03:18:15,200 --> 03:18:18,000
I'm outrunning the game generating these areas.

2602
03:18:18,320 --> 03:18:18,700
Almost.

2603
03:18:23,140 --> 03:18:24,400
Massive... Wait, is that the one I saw?

2604
03:18:25,520 --> 03:18:25,940
Earlier.

2605
03:18:28,140 --> 03:18:30,180
That means I'm not too far away from home, I think.

2606
03:18:45,410 --> 03:18:47,290
Imagine crossing this sea with a boat.

2607
03:18:54,970 --> 03:19:00,330
I wonder... I guess the best way to go down would be like a... What's it called?

2608
03:19:01,210 --> 03:19:03,130
Brachistokrone or whatever the fuck that curve is called.

2609
03:19:09,190 --> 03:19:09,990
Danish cows?

2610
03:19:16,570 --> 03:19:18,270
I think they're trying to FaceTime me.

2611
03:19:18,810 --> 03:19:20,070
I deny it.

2612
03:19:24,230 --> 03:19:25,170
They tried.

2613
03:19:26,810 --> 03:19:27,950
Not this time, though.

2614
03:19:35,250 --> 03:19:39,270
It's amazing what a bit of blast powder and sugar can do, huh?

2615
03:19:39,950 --> 03:19:40,810
To get you home.

2616
03:19:43,940 --> 03:19:45,680
Dude, I've been holding W this entire time.

2617
03:19:45,740 --> 03:19:46,920
I just discovered I can let go.

2618
03:19:50,480 --> 03:19:51,620
I don't need to hold W.

2619
03:19:54,360 --> 03:19:55,080
Or maybe I do.

2620
03:19:55,220 --> 03:19:55,460
Hold on.

2621
03:19:56,040 --> 03:19:56,960
No, it doesn't change anything.

2622
03:20:05,000 --> 03:20:06,380
Man, I'm far away from home.

2623
03:20:17,300 --> 03:20:18,560
Look at this place.

2624
03:20:23,960 --> 03:20:24,400
Damn.

2625
03:20:31,100 --> 03:20:33,660
We're definitely getting to see some sights here on this trip.

2626
03:20:43,460 --> 03:20:45,280
I'm playing with just my right hand right now.

2627
03:20:49,660 --> 03:20:50,760
It's so much more comfortable.

2628
03:21:16,990 --> 03:21:17,830
Give me speed.

2629
03:21:18,230 --> 03:21:31,630
I feel like I reached terminal velocity, so maybe the trick is to... reach terminal velocity and then go as shallow as you can with that terminal velocity instead of trying to go down and speed even more up, because that's just bleeding off energy I could use.

2630
03:21:33,010 --> 03:21:35,190
Like, you reach terminal and then you go like this.

2631
03:21:38,530 --> 03:21:39,290
Let me try that.

2632
03:21:39,630 --> 03:21:40,090
So we go up.

2633
03:21:43,780 --> 03:21:45,220
Now we reach terminal fast.

2634
03:21:46,860 --> 03:21:48,320
Like this, and now we go like this.

2635
03:21:48,740 --> 03:21:52,260
So we have a lot of speed going this way.

2636
03:21:56,460 --> 03:21:57,900
Like that.

2637
03:21:58,660 --> 03:22:00,820
I feel like I'm slowing down slightly at that angle.

2638
03:22:08,580 --> 03:22:10,440
Dude, are we gonna get home on three rockets?

2639
03:22:12,560 --> 03:22:14,740
I would make a prediction if I wasn't busy flying.

2640
03:22:17,380 --> 03:22:20,720
I'm gonna say... yes.

2641
03:22:23,080 --> 03:22:24,080
We're making it home.

2642
03:22:30,000 --> 03:22:31,540
Oh god, I'm lagging so much.

2643
03:22:35,860 --> 03:22:37,680
Yo, look at that mountain over there.

2644
03:22:37,780 --> 03:22:40,260
That looks cool with the cave and the waterfall in front.

2645
03:22:41,460 --> 03:22:42,000
Doesn't it?

2646
03:22:43,300 --> 03:22:45,240
Wait, village, we gotta make a pit stop.

2647
03:22:47,060 --> 03:22:47,680
Pit stop.

2648
03:22:49,040 --> 03:22:50,160
Let's see if they have carrots.

2649
03:22:50,620 --> 03:22:51,140
Are those carrots?

2650
03:22:53,540 --> 03:22:54,700
Looks like wheat to me.

2651
03:22:55,700 --> 03:22:57,220
Maybe they trade for carrots.

2652
03:22:58,080 --> 03:22:58,460
Hey.

2653
03:22:59,700 --> 03:23:00,820
I'm gonna zoom on you.

2654
03:23:03,050 --> 03:23:04,470
Wait, I don't have any money, I guess.

2655
03:23:04,770 --> 03:23:04,910
Oh.

2656
03:23:07,370 --> 03:23:08,150
Oh, no.

2657
03:23:10,330 --> 03:23:12,250
These guys are not dealing in carrots, huh?

2658
03:23:14,650 --> 03:23:15,050
Wait.

2659
03:23:16,530 --> 03:23:17,270
Have I been here?

2660
03:23:18,510 --> 03:23:19,210
Doors open?

2661
03:23:19,730 --> 03:23:20,830
Does that mean I've been here?

2662
03:23:22,450 --> 03:23:24,090
Or did they forget to close it?

2663
03:23:33,200 --> 03:23:34,040
I've been here.

2664
03:23:34,340 --> 03:23:35,060
I think.

2665
03:23:48,180 --> 03:23:49,100
Okay, get home.

2666
03:24:22,870 --> 03:24:23,590
No way!

2667
03:24:24,490 --> 03:24:26,230
I'm making it home on this rocket!

2668
03:24:36,300 --> 03:24:39,180
Yeah, I've got rocket to spare.

2669
03:24:42,440 --> 03:24:42,940
Amazing.

2670
03:24:44,180 --> 03:24:45,900
I thought I was way further away.

2671
03:24:46,820 --> 03:24:49,020
Oh, man, it feels good to be home.

2672
03:24:51,540 --> 03:24:53,080
Let's hang this on the mantle.

2673
03:24:53,900 --> 03:24:55,040
You did well today.

2674
03:24:55,560 --> 03:24:56,420
I'm gonna rub it.

2675
03:24:58,420 --> 03:24:59,140
Very good.

2676
03:25:00,340 --> 03:25:01,080
Very good.

2677
03:25:01,240 --> 03:25:01,640
Very good.

2678
03:25:01,820 --> 03:25:02,240
Oh, man.

2679
03:25:02,420 --> 03:25:02,860
Oh, man.

2680
03:25:03,940 --> 03:25:05,740
Dude, what a trip.

2681
03:25:06,560 --> 03:25:07,460
And you know what?

2682
03:25:07,620 --> 03:25:08,740
We've got iron now.

2683
03:25:09,700 --> 03:25:10,420
Lots of it.

2684
03:25:12,260 --> 03:25:13,580
Let's bring it to the factory.

2685
03:25:16,780 --> 03:25:17,300
Unbelievable.

2686
03:25:22,260 --> 03:25:23,640
Let's put it right here.

2687
03:25:24,640 --> 03:25:26,240
No, let's... downstairs.

2688
03:25:33,290 --> 03:25:35,630
Man, it feels good to be home.

2689
03:25:36,010 --> 03:25:37,250
Oh, it's so real.

2690
03:25:42,870 --> 03:25:44,750
We got three smithing templates.

2691
03:25:46,690 --> 03:25:47,890
And one... wait.

2692
03:25:49,090 --> 03:25:50,250
Yeah, netherite upgrade.

2693
03:25:50,470 --> 03:25:50,830
Fantastic.

2694
03:25:52,690 --> 03:25:55,670
And these ones... oh, we brought home the goodies.

2695
03:26:01,240 --> 03:26:04,280
And of course, let's not forget that and iron.

2696
03:26:07,020 --> 03:26:07,640
Iron!

2697
03:26:10,760 --> 03:26:12,560
We got lots of it actually somewhere.

2698
03:26:13,500 --> 03:26:14,520
There we go.

2699
03:26:15,940 --> 03:26:17,360
Let's put in some crap.

2700
03:26:18,840 --> 03:26:20,140
That I don't want.

2701
03:26:24,360 --> 03:26:25,460
Actually, is that all I got?

2702
03:26:25,620 --> 03:26:26,980
Is that really all the iron I got?

2703
03:26:28,720 --> 03:26:29,340
Not bad.

2704
03:26:30,240 --> 03:26:30,720
It's alright.

2705
03:26:31,400 --> 03:26:32,260
Let's go cook it.

2706
03:26:38,800 --> 03:26:41,160
We're gonna... I think we're gonna blast it.

2707
03:26:42,820 --> 03:26:43,660
Just blast it.

2708
03:26:44,620 --> 03:26:46,120
And this is still intact, right?

2709
03:26:46,200 --> 03:26:47,220
Everything works here?

2710
03:26:47,380 --> 03:26:48,000
I think it does.

2711
03:26:50,060 --> 03:26:51,180
In you go, baby.

2712
03:26:52,980 --> 03:26:54,620
Smithing template, let's make it happen.

2713
03:26:56,140 --> 03:26:57,920
So first we gotta go to this oven here.

2714
03:26:58,980 --> 03:27:00,220
And put this in.

2715
03:27:01,480 --> 03:27:01,880
Yes.

2716
03:27:03,240 --> 03:27:05,040
Hold on, actually, before I do, let me see here.

2717
03:27:06,540 --> 03:27:06,940
Ancient...

2718
03:27:08,320 --> 03:27:11,060
Oh man, I wish I could crush it with a crushing wheel.

2719
03:27:11,540 --> 03:27:13,040
And then something cool would happen.

2720
03:27:14,420 --> 03:27:15,260
But I'll take it.

2721
03:27:15,460 --> 03:27:16,140
This is fine too.

2722
03:27:17,900 --> 03:27:19,000
Let's go grab our stuff.

2723
03:27:24,340 --> 03:27:24,720
What?

2724
03:27:25,860 --> 03:27:27,180
Wait a minute, we have a malfunction.

